(357627, 28567, 5475, '<td valign="top">Pretty cool shot!  I like this alot...  Doesn''t it just drive you nuts not being able to spot edit the defect in one of the dimples?  Just goes to show you are following the rules.  Nice composition, nice sharp focus and DOF.  Lighting is great!  Great image this week!  Good luck.<br/>JD Anderson</td>', 'Pretty cool shot!  I like this alot...  Doesn''t it just drive you nuts not being able to spot edit the defect in one of the dimples?  Just goes to show you are following the rules.  Nice composition, nice sharp focus and DOF.  Lighting is great!  Great image this week!  Good luck.JD Anderson', '2003-07-16 02:03:42.000000', NULL, 1),
