(358016, 28063, 9343, '<td valign="top">It''s a good shot but i think the border will hurt you with voters in this site (not me though as i am a bit of a border freak). The border is a tad big compared to the image. I would go about a 5 pixel white inner and a 10 to 12 pixel black outer. Give it a try and see how it looks. I used to do 30 pixel black borders but have cut down and like it much better.</td>', 'It''s a good shot but i think the border will hurt you with voters in this site (not me though as i am a bit of a border freak). The border is a tad big compared to the image. I would go about a 5 pixel white inner and a 10 to 12 pixel black outer. Give it a try and see how it looks. I used to do 30 pixel black borders but have cut down and like it much better.', '2003-07-16 06:20:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(358018, 28936, 8843, '<td valign="top">I personally feel that the car on the left is a little distracting hehe but love the blues in this picture :D</td>', 'I personally feel that the car on the left is a little distracting hehe but love the blues in this picture :D', '2003-07-16 06:21:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(358019, 28071, 9343, '<td valign="top">Nice play on words :) Cute round little girl. Hope she signed a model release as she doesn''t look impressed :)</td>', 'Nice play on words :) Cute round little girl. Hope she signed a model release as she doesn''t look impressed :)', '2003-07-16 06:22:19.000000', NULL, 1);
