(358046, 28441, 8843, '<td valign="top">personally I might cropped the bottom off :) but that''s just me :P nice work tho :D</td>', 'personally I might cropped the bottom off :) but that''s just me :P nice work tho :D', '2003-07-16 06:58:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(358047, 29175, 6938, '<td valign="top">I like the choice of subject.  Nice detail from the straw.</td>', 'I like the choice of subject.  Nice detail from the straw.', '2003-07-16 06:58:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(358049, 28933, 6938, '<td valign="top">I like the way your title leads to the word `round''.  Perhaps a bit more of the wheel would have been good - just a little more to have a greater impact.<br/>Not a normal suggestion from me:  Did you have a look at a border (fairly thin, deep blue from the centre of the wheel)? It may have stopped the eye from wanting to wander out of the photo.</td>', 'I like the way your title leads to the word `round''.  Perhaps a bit more of the wheel would have been good - just a little more to have a greater impact.Not a normal suggestion from me:  Did you have a look at a border (fairly thin, deep blue from the centre of the wheel)? It may have stopped the eye from wanting to wander out of the photo.', '2003-07-16 07:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(358050, 29166, 6938, '<td valign="top">I like the silhouette idea.  But perhaps a bit more light would have had more impact, and given more character and interest to this scene.</td>', 'I like the silhouette idea.  But perhaps a bit more light would have had more impact, and given more character and interest to this scene.', '2003-07-16 07:07:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(358054, 28959, 6938, '<td valign="top">Perhaps a slight angle would have given the rings a bit more character.  At the moment the writing is holding too much attention.</td>', 'Perhaps a slight angle would have given the rings a bit more character.  At the moment the writing is holding too much attention.', '2003-07-16 07:13:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(358055, 28587, 7570, '<td valign="top">it would be nicer if all 4 of the marbles have tight focus. 7</td>', 'it would be nicer if all 4 of the marbles have tight focus. 7', '2003-07-16 07:14:18.000000', NULL, 1),
