(358069, 29018, 9073, '<td valign="top">I know that it''s intentional, but the focusing puts me off somewhat. I do feel drawn into the center, however.</td>', 'I know that it''s intentional, but the focusing puts me off somewhat. I do feel drawn into the center, however.', '2003-07-16 07:31:06.000000', NULL, 1),
