(358101, 28717, 6740, '<td valign="top">Good DOF, image is detailed, crisp, and very detailed.  I may have tried a little more crop on the right side but other than that. Good looking photo.</td>', 'Good DOF, image is detailed, crisp, and very detailed.  I may have tried a little more crop on the right side but other than that. Good looking photo.', '2003-07-16 08:05:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(358102, 28716, 9287, '<td valign="top">good idea and nice DOF</td>', 'good idea and nice DOF', '2003-07-16 08:08:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(358103, 29175, 6740, '<td valign="top">Good topic. I may have tried a different angle or approach but maybe that was not possible.</td>', 'Good topic. I may have tried a different angle or approach but maybe that was not possible.', '2003-07-16 08:09:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(358104, 28483, 6913, '<td valign="top">More shallow bowl and a napkin or coloured cardboard as a background would have finished this photo.</td>', 'More shallow bowl and a napkin or coloured cardboard as a background would have finished this photo.', '2003-07-16 08:09:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(358106, 28899, 9448, '<td valign="top">To be honest I wasn''t quite sure what to make of this, as I wasn''t sure if you wanted the background in focus or the front marble.  I assume the front marble, in which case you have slight back focus.  You have good use of thirds, and I will assume that the back focus was deliberate.  Though I would have preferred to see the front marble in focus.  Also you got good depth of field.</td>', 'To be honest I wasn''t quite sure what to make of this, as I wasn''t sure if you wanted the background in focus or the front marble.  I assume the front marble, in which case you have slight back focus.  You have good use of thirds, and I will assume that the back focus was deliberate.  Though I would have preferred to see the front marble in focus.  Also you got good depth of field.', '2003-07-16 08:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(358108, 28224, 6740, '<td valign="top">Good DOF but don''t really care for the background colors.</td>', 'Good DOF but don''t really care for the background colors.', '2003-07-16 08:10:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(358109, 28455, 9448, '<td valign="top">Interesting title (though I''m not sure it fits the picture -- however neither did mine), and I''m amazed that he didn''t get a reflection in the glass -- very well done.</td>', 'Interesting title (though I''m not sure it fits the picture -- however neither did mine), and I''m amazed that he didn''t get a reflection in the glass -- very well done.', '2003-07-16 08:12:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(358111, 28614, 7689, '<td valign="top">Light is too bright on the top edge...</td>', 'Light is too bright on the top edge...', '2003-07-16 08:13:40.000000', NULL, 1),
