(358126, 29057, 9448, '<td valign="top">The clever title makes this for me (Draws attention away from flower), as otherwise it''s just another flower shot -- too much of a cliche.  It''s just a thought, but was there a chance you could have put the bee on a third, as it is very close?  Good focus.  6.</td>', 'The clever title makes this for me (Draws attention away from flower), as otherwise it''s just another flower shot -- too much of a cliche.  It''s just a thought, but was there a chance you could have put the bee on a third, as it is very close?  Good focus.  6.', '2003-07-16 08:20:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(358129, 28635, 6740, '<td valign="top">It meets the topic but is filled with too many items. Good try though.</td>', 'It meets the topic but is filled with too many items. Good try though.', '2003-07-16 08:25:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(358133, 29109, 6740, '<td valign="top">I like this shot.  Excellent job with the layout and tones. Some may disagree but I like what you have accomplished here.</td>', 'I like this shot.  Excellent job with the layout and tones. Some may disagree but I like what you have accomplished here.', '2003-07-16 08:29:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(358135, 28420, 9448, '<td valign="top">I really like the photo, but it doesn''t quite meet the challenge to me.  I will give you the benefit of the doubt, but really would have liked to see the lighthouse as the feature of the picture -- not just some part of it that the title has to make.  It''s just a thought, but maybe you could have cropped the image so that the lighthouse was the main focus with the trees around it, or possibly you could have put the lighthouse on a third.  One feature of the photo that was offputting was the sunlight pouring through the trees too intensely.<br/>If your camera is good enough (I don''t know what camera you have) then you should have got the resolution to just use the lighthouse as though the trees in the bottom left corner were the border.</td>', 'I really like the photo, but it doesn''t quite meet the challenge to me.  I will give you the benefit of the doubt, but really would have liked to see the lighthouse as the feature of the picture -- not just some part of it that the title has to make.  It''s just a thought, but maybe you could have cropped the image so that the lighthouse was the main focus with the trees around it, or possibly you could have put the lighthouse on a third.  One feature of the photo that was offputting was the sunlight pouring through the trees too intensely.If your camera is good enough (I don''t know what camera you have) then you should have got the resolution to just use the lighthouse as though the trees in the bottom left corner were the border.', '2003-07-16 08:30:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(358139, 29109, 9854, '<td valign="top">totally surreal</td>', 'totally surreal', '2003-07-16 08:33:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(358140, 28576, 6740, '<td valign="top">Like your photo. I may have tried a different backgound color, but then again,  I''m far from being an expert so take that comment in stride.</td>', 'Like your photo. I may have tried a different backgound color, but then again,  I''m far from being an expert so take that comment in stride.', '2003-07-16 08:33:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(358141, 29147, 6740, '<td valign="top">Nice shot off the tee.  Definitely a gimme.</td>', 'Nice shot off the tee.  Definitely a gimme.', '2003-07-16 08:35:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(358142, 29123, 9854, '<td valign="top">Maybe it would have been a more effective picture if we get to see more of the spider than the web. Were you afraid of taking a closer shot? :)</td>', 'Maybe it would have been a more effective picture if we get to see more of the spider than the web. Were you afraid of taking a closer shot? :)', '2003-07-16 08:35:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(358145, 29026, 9448, '<td valign="top">I don''t know if your camera supports it, but my main suggestion would be to use manual focus on this type of picture.  As the lighting conditions are very difficult for an autofocus system.  Good picture, and a good idea.</td>', 'I don''t know if your camera supports it, but my main suggestion would be to use manual focus on this type of picture.  As the lighting conditions are very difficult for an autofocus system.  Good picture, and a good idea.', '2003-07-16 08:37:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(358148, 28559, 8274, '<td valign="top">A simple experiment that makes an interesting result</td>', 'A simple experiment that makes an interesting result', '2003-07-16 08:39:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(358149, 28473, 9448, '<td valign="top">Clever, I like the idea.  The depth of field was very good, had you lost it it would have been debatable as to whether or not you would have met the challenge.  Good crisp focus, it is just a shame that it is almost impossible to get the shell on a third and still make the picture look good.  My favourite picture so far.</td>', 'Clever, I like the idea.  The depth of field was very good, had you lost it it would have been debatable as to whether or not you would have met the challenge.  Good crisp focus, it is just a shame that it is almost impossible to get the shell on a third and still make the picture look good.  My favourite picture so far.', '2003-07-16 08:40:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(358154, 28783, 9448, '<td valign="top">Lovely, did you just get that effect from the clouds? Or did you make it?  Either way are very good picture.</td>', 'Lovely, did you just get that effect from the clouds? Or did you make it?  Either way are very good picture.', '2003-07-16 08:43:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(358162, 28805, 8522, '<td valign="top">Took a very long look at this one to see what doesn\''t quite sit right with me. At first glance, it looks great, and LOTS of round. However, I don\''t think there\''s enough sharpness, and it looks like there\''s a yellow cast to the image (I know the backround is yellow!! But the highlights on the rings look too yellow). I\''m not crazy about the composition, and feel you could have been more creative with the shadows. 7<br/></td>', 'Took a very long look at this one to see what doesn\''t quite sit right with me. At first glance, it looks great, and LOTS of round. However, I don\''t think there\''s enough sharpness, and it looks like there\''s a yellow cast to the image (I know the backround is yellow!! But the highlights on the rings look too yellow). I\''m not crazy about the composition, and feel you could have been more creative with the shadows. 7', '2003-07-16 08:48:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(358168, 28186, 200, '<td valign="top">One of my favorites of the challenge. Nice job!</td>', 'One of my favorites of the challenge. Nice job!', '2003-07-16 08:49:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(358169, 28537, 200, '<td valign="top">This is just great..10</td>', 'This is just great..10', '2003-07-16 08:50:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(358170, 28228, 8522, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, it would have worked a lot better if you had managed to diffuse the shadows better! The glare on the glass is a little offputting. Great high-key image. 7</td>', 'Nice idea, it would have worked a lot better if you had managed to diffuse the shadows better! The glare on the glass is a little offputting. Great high-key image. 7', '2003-07-16 08:50:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(358171, 29013, 3094, '<td valign="top">keep submitting! You''re doing just fine.<br/></td>', 'keep submitting! You''re doing just fine.', '2003-07-16 08:50:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(358173, 29054, 200, '<td valign="top">wow...I love it!</td>', 'wow...I love it!', '2003-07-16 08:51:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(358176, 28576, 8522, '<td valign="top">Light is too harsh, you can see this from the highlights and the sharply defined shadows. Try this shot at the end of the day! Composition seems a litle off. I don''t like the one that is cut in half at the top left. Not a very inspiring background. 4</td>', 'Light is too harsh, you can see this from the highlights and the sharply defined shadows. Try this shot at the end of the day! Composition seems a litle off. I don''t like the one that is cut in half at the top left. Not a very inspiring background. 4', '2003-07-16 08:52:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(358179, 29149, 9849, '<td valign="top">10 - Best shot I have seen in the round challenge. Nice colours and detail<br/></td>', '10 - Best shot I have seen in the round challenge. Nice colours and detail', '2003-07-16 08:54:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(358181, 29177, 3094, '<td valign="top">The border really helps define the picture.</td>', 'The border really helps define the picture.', '2003-07-16 08:55:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(358184, 28071, 8522, '<td valign="top">Very amusing, a real laugh out loud picture. Unfortunately, this is why I can''t mark it highly... it''s not very flattering, is it? Lighting is very harsh, and it is a really strange expression you''ve captured. The skin tones look a bit odd at the edge of the picture. 4</td>', 'Very amusing, a real laugh out loud picture. Unfortunately, this is why I can''t mark it highly... it''s not very flattering, is it? Lighting is very harsh, and it is a really strange expression you''ve captured. The skin tones look a bit odd at the edge of the picture. 4', '2003-07-16 08:57:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(358185, 29187, 8522, '<td valign="top">Very nice idea, but the glare spoils it for me. It looks a bit overexposed. A shame, because I think there potentially are a lot of interesting textures in here. 4</td>', 'Very nice idea, but the glare spoils it for me. It looks a bit overexposed. A shame, because I think there potentially are a lot of interesting textures in here. 4', '2003-07-16 08:58:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(358186, 28788, 10167, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t really make me think "round" at all!!</td>', 'Doesn''t really make me think "round" at all!!', '2003-07-16 08:59:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(358187, 28533, 3094, '<td valign="top">Nice Try</td>', 'Nice Try', '2003-07-16 09:00:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(358193, 29066, 8522, '<td valign="top">A great idea, I like the juxtaposition of the square patterns in the backround with the round dice. However, the lighting really lets you down here. It''s much too harsh. and I don''t care for the composition. It''s a matter of taste, but I might have tried shooting from above with 2 diffused light sources. 6</td>', 'A great idea, I like the juxtaposition of the square patterns in the backround with the round dice. However, the lighting really lets you down here. It''s much too harsh. and I don''t care for the composition. It''s a matter of taste, but I might have tried shooting from above with 2 diffused light sources. 6', '2003-07-16 09:06:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(358203, 28386, 10167, '<td valign="top">Nice pic.  Lots of round!  Good job.</td>', 'Nice pic.  Lots of round!  Good job.', '2003-07-16 09:11:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(358205, 28398, 8522, '<td valign="top">The eye is not in focus. Lighting is not very flattering. 4</td>', 'The eye is not in focus. Lighting is not very flattering. 4', '2003-07-16 09:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(358208, 28556, 8522, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colours, perfect exposure. The morning light is very kind to your tomatoes. Great dof. However, the composition is too centred for my taste. 7</td>', 'Beautiful colours, perfect exposure. The morning light is very kind to your tomatoes. Great dof. However, the composition is too centred for my taste. 7', '2003-07-16 09:14:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(358210, 29061, 8522, '<td valign="top">Huh? Am I meant to know something about agriculture? Where''s the roundness? 3</td>', 'Huh? Am I meant to know something about agriculture? Where''s the roundness? 3', '2003-07-16 09:15:31.000000', NULL, 1),
