(358214, 28393, 9854, '<td valign="top">pitcher plant? nice purples</td>', 'pitcher plant? nice purples', '2003-07-16 09:17:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(358217, 29019, 10167, '<td valign="top">Nice work!</td>', 'Nice work!', '2003-07-16 09:19:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(358218, 28456, 9854, '<td valign="top">Beautiful! The negative space works very well here</td>', 'Beautiful! The negative space works very well here', '2003-07-16 09:19:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(358219, 28853, 8522, '<td valign="top">VERY nice composition, but the light is far too harsh. Did you take this midday? A shame... I really like the shapes, the stark white, the roof at the top right. A shot at the end of the day could still provide you with shadows, but also bring out some of the colours in the window. 6</td>', 'VERY nice composition, but the light is far too harsh. Did you take this midday? A shame... I really like the shapes, the stark white, the roof at the top right. A shot at the end of the day could still provide you with shadows, but also bring out some of the colours in the window. 6', '2003-07-16 09:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(358223, 29153, 6520, '<td valign="top">i give you a 10</td>', 'i give you a 10', '2003-07-16 09:22:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(358224, 28960, 8522, '<td valign="top">A great shot! Unfortunately, I think you''ve focused on the bridge of his/her nose rather than the eyes, and the dof is really shallow. Lighting is a bit too harsh, the glare on the eyes really detracts. Great composition though. 7</td>', 'A great shot! Unfortunately, I think you''ve focused on the bridge of his/her nose rather than the eyes, and the dof is really shallow. Lighting is a bit too harsh, the glare on the eyes really detracts. Great composition though. 7', '2003-07-16 09:23:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(358225, 28554, 10167, '<td valign="top">Nice pic...  I''m a little distracted by the reflection though and think it would have brought out the "round" you were trying to capture if it were not there.</td>', 'Nice pic...  I''m a little distracted by the reflection though and think it would have brought out the "round" you were trying to capture if it were not there.', '2003-07-16 09:23:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(358227, 28865, 5728, '<td valign="top">I know how you did this! You used a tele-converter and zoomed the lens right back right? Cool effect. I like the off center shadow in the middle - 9.</td>', 'I know how you did this! You used a tele-converter and zoomed the lens right back right? Cool effect. I like the off center shadow in the middle - 9.', '2003-07-16 09:24:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(358228, 28879, 9918, '<td valign="top">Well done</td>', 'Well done', '2003-07-16 09:25:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(358229, 29144, 8522, '<td valign="top">Your picture is only 100k and has visible JPEG artifacting... try to get as near to 150k as you can for the next one! Great colours, your border is very effective. I like your idea of having the stem(?) leaving the picture at the top left diagonal. Great textures. Maybe a bit too centred and simple for repeated viewing. 8</td>', 'Your picture is only 100k and has visible JPEG artifacting... try to get as near to 150k as you can for the next one! Great colours, your border is very effective. I like your idea of having the stem(?) leaving the picture at the top left diagonal. Great textures. Maybe a bit too centred and simple for repeated viewing. 8', '2003-07-16 09:26:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(358233, 28939, 9886, '<td valign="top">Superb, love it ... but I have to move on quickly before my vision screws up too much! Brilliantly done.</td>', 'Superb, love it ... but I have to move on quickly before my vision screws up too much! Brilliantly done.', '2003-07-16 09:29:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(358234, 28672, 5964, '<td valign="top">Wow what a cool shot, this is sure one of my tops for this week. I just love the detail you were able to get on the frogs skin, it even looks all slimy eww. There are some weird light reflection on the eyes and skin, but I am sure they could not be avoided with the shiny/reflectiveness of your subjuct.10</td>', 'Wow what a cool shot, this is sure one of my tops for this week. I just love the detail you were able to get on the frogs skin, it even looks all slimy eww. There are some weird light reflection on the eyes and skin, but I am sure they could not be avoided with the shiny/reflectiveness of your subjuct.10', '2003-07-16 09:30:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(358236, 28882, 8522, '<td valign="top">Terrible border. Although the sun is round, I feel that the photo doesn''t really explore ''roundness''. Not crazy about the composition of the various hills. Everything seems to be at a slight slope... your foreground, the general horizon, the clouds... it makes me feel a bit dizzy. 6</td>', 'Terrible border. Although the sun is round, I feel that the photo doesn''t really explore ''roundness''. Not crazy about the composition of the various hills. Everything seems to be at a slight slope... your foreground, the general horizon, the clouds... it makes me feel a bit dizzy. 6', '2003-07-16 09:31:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(358239, 28465, 8522, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t seem in focus. Compositionally not very inspired.</td>', 'Doesn''t seem in focus. Compositionally not very inspired.', '2003-07-16 09:34:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(358240, 28130, 9854, '<td valign="top">beautiful!</td>', 'beautiful!', '2003-07-16 09:34:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(358241, 28709, 5964, '<td valign="top">I just love this, the blue glow is just sooo eerie! I am amazed at the detail that you picked up at which seems to be a low light photo. The only detractor is the blue dot on the lower right which seems to come out of nowhere.  Taken at an aquarium? 9</td>', 'I just love this, the blue glow is just sooo eerie! I am amazed at the detail that you picked up at which seems to be a low light photo. The only detractor is the blue dot on the lower right which seems to come out of nowhere.  Taken at an aquarium? 9', '2003-07-16 09:34:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(358244, 28547, 9448, '<td valign="top">Don''t make me hungry :-)</td>', 'Don''t make me hungry :-)', '2003-07-16 09:40:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(358246, 29135, 8522, '<td valign="top">The eye apperars to be out of focus. Not very flattering light. The gunk on one of the eyelashes doesn''t help. Too much glare on the eye. 4</td>', 'The eye apperars to be out of focus. Not very flattering light. The gunk on one of the eyelashes doesn''t help. Too much glare on the eye. 4', '2003-07-16 09:41:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(358247, 29103, 8522, '<td valign="top">I don''t care for the shadow in the upper right. Which is a shame, as I love this picture. Nice architectural detail. Works well in black and white. 7</td>', 'I don''t care for the shadow in the upper right. Which is a shame, as I love this picture. Nice architectural detail. Works well in black and white. 7', '2003-07-16 09:43:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(358248, 29061, 10167, '<td valign="top">Very nice picture, but it doesn''t make me think round when I see it or the title...</td>', 'Very nice picture, but it doesn''t make me think round when I see it or the title...', '2003-07-16 09:43:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(358249, 28587, 9886, '<td valign="top">Beautiful half-crescents below the marbles, exquisitely done! 8.</td>', 'Beautiful half-crescents below the marbles, exquisitely done! 8.', '2003-07-16 09:43:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(358250, 28420, 8522, '<td valign="top">Noisy is an understatement for this picture. Has it been oversharpened? The texture of the trees is very disturbing. Nice light though, well exposed. Doesn''t really explore ''roundness'' for me. 6</td>', 'Noisy is an understatement for this picture. Has it been oversharpened? The texture of the trees is very disturbing. Nice light though, well exposed. Doesn''t really explore ''roundness'' for me. 6', '2003-07-16 09:45:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(358251, 28928, 9886, '<td valign="top">Paiiin!</td>', 'Paiiin!', '2003-07-16 09:45:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(358252, 28162, 7531, '<td valign="top">Very round but what is it?</td>', 'Very round but what is it?', '2003-07-16 09:46:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(358253, 29013, 8522, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot, a bit too centred for my taste. Bit too much glare on the spokes of the wheel. Nice shot other than that, keep submitting! 6</td>', 'Interesting shot, a bit too centred for my taste. Bit too much glare on the spokes of the wheel. Nice shot other than that, keep submitting! 6', '2003-07-16 09:46:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(358255, 28883, 7531, '<td valign="top">I like the statue, but on closer inspection it looks like there has been some editing aound the statue</td>', 'I like the statue, but on closer inspection it looks like there has been some editing aound the statue', '2003-07-16 09:47:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(358258, 29177, 5728, '<td valign="top">This is my favourite of all the moon pics. I just love the negative space of total blackness. Also it isn''t often that I comment on a border, but this one is very good and fits perfectly - 10.</td>', 'This is my favourite of all the moon pics. I just love the negative space of total blackness. Also it isn''t often that I comment on a border, but this one is very good and fits perfectly - 10.', '2003-07-16 09:48:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(358259, 28690, 8522, '<td valign="top">Wow, I really like the blur on this one. Dof is great,  very nice feel. I don''t like the composition though, I would have prefered the subject at the bottom with plenty of empty space at the top. Great colours and saturation. 7</td>', 'Wow, I really like the blur on this one. Dof is great,  very nice feel. I don''t like the composition though, I would have prefered the subject at the bottom with plenty of empty space at the top. Great colours and saturation. 7', '2003-07-16 09:48:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(358260, 28812, 5964, '<td valign="top">This is a really good setup shot. I love the DOF on the background unabtrusive, but you know it is a wedding shot. The rings really signify roundness and you captured much detail/reflections on them.  The placement is good, I may have gone just a bit lower as to not cover up as much of the groom.  I like how you laid the brides ring on the groom as just in the pic. Now to be nitpicky there seems to be some dust and noise in the lower left cornerand in the right corner the arm of the bride shows color where the rest fo the photo looks B&amp;W. Pver all outstanding shot.9.</td>', 'This is a really good setup shot. I love the DOF on the background unabtrusive, but you know it is a wedding shot. The rings really signify roundness and you captured much detail/reflections on them.  The placement is good, I may have gone just a bit lower as to not cover up as much of the groom.  I like how you laid the brides ring on the groom as just in the pic. Now to be nitpicky there seems to be some dust and noise in the lower left cornerand in the right corner the arm of the bride shows color where the rest fo the photo looks B&W. Pver all outstanding shot.9.', '2003-07-16 09:49:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(358263, 28870, 7531, '<td valign="top">I like this picture, something spinning, not sure what, good contrast in colours, and sharp where it needs to be! What is it</td>', 'I like this picture, something spinning, not sure what, good contrast in colours, and sharp where it needs to be! What is it', '2003-07-16 09:51:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(358264, 28532, 8522, '<td valign="top">Superb photo, but I''m not sure how this is an exploration of ''roundness''. Background is particularly effective. 5</td>', 'Superb photo, but I''m not sure how this is an exploration of ''roundness''. Background is particularly effective. 5', '2003-07-16 09:52:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(358265, 29185, 7531, '<td valign="top">A bit bright at the top, you might of wished to adjust the contrast slightly differently</td>', 'A bit bright at the top, you might of wished to adjust the contrast slightly differently', '2003-07-16 09:53:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(358267, 28622, 7531, '<td valign="top">Great shot, beautiful colours and sharpness is perfect</td>', 'Great shot, beautiful colours and sharpness is perfect', '2003-07-16 09:55:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(358268, 29194, 8522, '<td valign="top">Ah, the view is from the top! Intriguing shot, very effective. Great turquoise colour. Nice composition. Effective lighting. 8</td>', 'Ah, the view is from the top! Intriguing shot, very effective. Great turquoise colour. Nice composition. Effective lighting. 8', '2003-07-16 09:55:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(358269, 28879, 7531, '<td valign="top">Good shot, good idea, just a little noisy</td>', 'Good shot, good idea, just a little noisy', '2003-07-16 09:56:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(358272, 28822, 4210, '<td valign="top">I think that this photo is really incrediable. I do however feel that the boarder detracts from it just slightly. Perhaps a small and tasteful black or dark gray boarder (or a white boarder without the shadow drop) would have been better. But, as I said, it''s a very slight peeve, so don''t worry about it. Again, I love it. Best of luck!</td>', 'I think that this photo is really incrediable. I do however feel that the boarder detracts from it just slightly. Perhaps a small and tasteful black or dark gray boarder (or a white boarder without the shadow drop) would have been better. But, as I said, it''s a very slight peeve, so don''t worry about it. Again, I love it. Best of luck!', '2003-07-16 09:56:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(358274, 28706, 8522, '<td valign="top">Nice idea for this challenge. Nice and sharp. I wonder if you tried slower shutter speeds to get a more flowing feel to the water and more sense of movement? Great light bearing in mind the moody clouds in the background. 8</td>', 'Nice idea for this challenge. Nice and sharp. I wonder if you tried slower shutter speeds to get a more flowing feel to the water and more sense of movement? Great light bearing in mind the moody clouds in the background. 8', '2003-07-16 09:58:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(358276, 29114, 7531, '<td valign="top">Far too dark an image, why is it so dark? Obviously an inside shot, if you have a camera where you can adjust the exposure value and shutter speed try it next time</td>', 'Far too dark an image, why is it so dark? Obviously an inside shot, if you have a camera where you can adjust the exposure value and shutter speed try it next time', '2003-07-16 09:59:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(358279, 28537, 4210, '<td valign="top">A wonderfully fascinating photo!</td>', 'A wonderfully fascinating photo!', '2003-07-16 09:59:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(358282, 28806, 4210, '<td valign="top">Kinda gross, but really cool. Not something I could have in my room if I was trying to sleep. ;)</td>', 'Kinda gross, but really cool. Not something I could have in my room if I was trying to sleep. ;)', '2003-07-16 10:02:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(358284, 28130, 4210, '<td valign="top">Very neat! I like it alot. Although, and I''m sure others have point this out.... -points to small crumb outside of boarder on left hand side- That''s okay. It''ll get spot edited out if you offer prints right? At any rate, it adds character. :)</td>', 'Very neat! I like it alot. Although, and I''m sure others have point this out.... -points to small crumb outside of boarder on left hand side- That''s okay. It''ll get spot edited out if you offer prints right? At any rate, it adds character. :)', '2003-07-16 10:04:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(358285, 28580, 8522, '<td valign="top">*Sigh*. Why do people insist on ruining their pictures with these borders? When the eye is taken away from the picture because the border is more interesting, the border is not doing it''s job.  A shame, because this is a good picture, nice colours, great light, perfect saturation, spot-on dof. 7</td>', '*Sigh*. Why do people insist on ruining their pictures with these borders? When the eye is taken away from the picture because the border is more interesting, the border is not doing it''s job.  A shame, because this is a good picture, nice colours, great light, perfect saturation, spot-on dof. 7', '2003-07-16 10:04:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(358286, 29105, 7531, '<td valign="top">Great except for the flash on the apple</td>', 'Great except for the flash on the apple', '2003-07-16 10:04:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(358287, 28567, 8522, '<td valign="top">Great lighting. 8</td>', 'Great lighting. 8', '2003-07-16 10:05:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(358289, 28551, 7531, '<td valign="top">Interesting composition, shame the flash is refelcted on the orange</td>', 'Interesting composition, shame the flash is refelcted on the orange', '2003-07-16 10:05:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(358290, 28376, 8522, '<td valign="top">Huh? Bit hard to work out what we''re looking at (well, I can see it''s a stomach, and from the title I can guess it''s a pregnant one, but that''s it).. 3</td>', 'Huh? Bit hard to work out what we''re looking at (well, I can see it''s a stomach, and from the title I can guess it''s a pregnant one, but that''s it).. 3', '2003-07-16 10:06:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(358291, 29054, 7531, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, very photo journalistic in style, one of my favourites so far</td>', 'Nice shot, very photo journalistic in style, one of my favourites so far', '2003-07-16 10:06:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(358293, 28785, 8522, '<td valign="top">Interesting sculpture, but it looks like no thought went into composing your background. The light and saturation is a bit flat. 4</td>', 'Interesting sculpture, but it looks like no thought went into composing your background. The light and saturation is a bit flat. 4', '2003-07-16 10:08:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(358294, 28420, 9633, '<td valign="top">wheres the round?</td>', 'wheres the round?', '2003-07-16 10:09:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(358295, 29177, 8522, '<td valign="top">Wow, I''ve seen so many moon pics now, and along comes this one. Just a moon, and nothing else, like all the others. It''s interesting how placing the moon at the bottom right corner with a nice border lifts this above the rest. An interesting lesson! 8</td>', 'Wow, I''ve seen so many moon pics now, and along comes this one. Just a moon, and nothing else, like all the others. It''s interesting how placing the moon at the bottom right corner with a nice border lifts this above the rest. An interesting lesson! 8', '2003-07-16 10:10:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(358296, 29093, 7531, '<td valign="top">One of the better shots for this challenge</td>', 'One of the better shots for this challenge', '2003-07-16 10:10:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(358298, 28186, 8522, '<td valign="top">Light is a bit harsh for my taste, but interesting architectural study. 7</td>', 'Light is a bit harsh for my taste, but interesting architectural study. 7', '2003-07-16 10:12:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(358300, 29106, 8522, '<td valign="top">Bit overexposed. A levels adjustment in Photoshop could help here. 4</td>', 'Bit overexposed. A levels adjustment in Photoshop could help here. 4', '2003-07-16 10:14:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(358301, 29019, 7531, '<td valign="top">Tunnel? Nice effect wahtever it is</td>', 'Tunnel? Nice effect wahtever it is', '2003-07-16 10:14:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(358302, 28980, 8522, '<td valign="top">Lemonsphere? Or Limesphere? A bit harshly lit, but some interesting textures here. Shame about the glare on the lime. Interesting composition... I''d have been tempted to place the lime either above or below it''s current position. Possibly above so the eye runs along it''s natural reading axis (top left to bottom right). 7</td>', 'Lemonsphere? Or Limesphere? A bit harshly lit, but some interesting textures here. Shame about the glare on the lime. Interesting composition... I''d have been tempted to place the lime either above or below it''s current position. Possibly above so the eye runs along it''s natural reading axis (top left to bottom right). 7', '2003-07-16 10:17:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(358303, 29109, 7531, '<td valign="top">Would look great as a high contrast black and white job</td>', 'Would look great as a high contrast black and white job', '2003-07-16 10:17:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(358311, 29119, 10189, '<td valign="top">The focus is not on the obvious place. I like that by itself. The idea is very good and does meet the challenge. I love the colors on the marbles.</td>', 'The focus is not on the obvious place. I like that by itself. The idea is very good and does meet the challenge. I love the colors on the marbles.', '2003-07-16 10:28:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(358314, 28587, 6284, '<td valign="top">Best marble photo.  Very nicely done.  How did you get the reflection to stop the way it does?</td>', 'Best marble photo.  Very nicely done.  How did you get the reflection to stop the way it does?', '2003-07-16 10:29:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(358320, 29192, 7570, '<td valign="top">too grainy...</td>', 'too grainy...', '2003-07-16 10:33:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(358321, 28435, 7531, '<td valign="top">I like these balls and the colours, the title fits well also! You should do well with your balls.</td>', 'I like these balls and the colours, the title fits well also! You should do well with your balls.', '2003-07-16 10:34:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(358324, 28341, 3735, '<td valign="top">the size of your photo is to small  try 640 X 427  and it is croped to thight at the top.  but it is in good focus and interesting.  6</td>', 'the size of your photo is to small  try 640 X 427  and it is croped to thight at the top.  but it is in good focus and interesting.  6', '2003-07-16 10:36:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(358327, 28911, 3735, '<td valign="top">lol cute title</td>', 'lol cute title', '2003-07-16 10:39:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(358328, 29168, 7570, '<td valign="top">poor cropping, blurry and grainy picture. The light reflected on the shiny dimples are un-uniformed and the background distracting. Subject (golf ball) colour is dull and saturated. You could have created a very nice "light and shadow" effect on this one, but I guess there are still things to work on.</td>', 'poor cropping, blurry and grainy picture. The light reflected on the shiny dimples are un-uniformed and the background distracting. Subject (golf ball) colour is dull and saturated. You could have created a very nice "light and shadow" effect on this one, but I guess there are still things to work on.', '2003-07-16 10:40:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(358329, 29102, 8522, '<td valign="top">Great lighting and colours, but too centred for my taste. Border is very effective. 8</td>', 'Great lighting and colours, but too centred for my taste. Border is very effective. 8', '2003-07-16 10:40:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(358330, 28304, 772, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful photo... I really don''t like the title though...  I feel like you are trying to tell me how the photo meets the challenge when it meets it very clearly to me...</td>', 'This is a beautiful photo... I really don''t like the title though...  I feel like you are trying to tell me how the photo meets the challenge when it meets it very clearly to me...', '2003-07-16 10:42:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(358331, 29121, 3735, '<td valign="top">cool shot</td>', 'cool shot', '2003-07-16 10:44:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(358332, 28883, 8522, '<td valign="top">What a great title... reminds me of Monty Python!<br/>Nice lighting at the front of the subject, shame about the shadow. Perhaps 2 light sources would have helped here. A little uncomfortable with existing artwork here. 7</td>', 'What a great title... reminds me of Monty Python!Nice lighting at the front of the subject, shame about the shadow. Perhaps 2 light sources would have helped here. A little uncomfortable with existing artwork here. 7', '2003-07-16 10:44:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(358333, 29179, 9886, '<td valign="top">Beautiful contrast between the round and the straight. Love it! 8.</td>', 'Beautiful contrast between the round and the straight. Love it! 8.', '2003-07-16 10:44:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(358334, 29107, 3735, '<td valign="top">good find</td>', 'good find', '2003-07-16 10:45:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(358336, 29183, 8522, '<td valign="top">Some people have too much time on their hands! Lol. Shame about the levels of noise, nice colour for your background though. Lighting is a bit harsh. 6</td>', 'Some people have too much time on their hands! Lol. Shame about the levels of noise, nice colour for your background though. Lighting is a bit harsh. 6', '2003-07-16 10:46:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(358340, 29185, 8522, '<td valign="top">What the heck is that?! Interesting object, shame the background is overexposed. Black and white is probably not the best option for this photo, as it cuts down the contrast between the ball and the background. 7</td>', 'What the heck is that?! Interesting object, shame the background is overexposed. Black and white is probably not the best option for this photo, as it cuts down the contrast between the ball and the background. 7', '2003-07-16 10:50:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(358342, 28453, 8522, '<td valign="top">Interesting composition, great subtle colours. 8</td>', 'Interesting composition, great subtle colours. 8', '2003-07-16 10:51:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(358346, 28706, 9886, '<td valign="top">Great shot, I can so feel it moving ... 7.</td>', 'Great shot, I can so feel it moving ... 7.', '2003-07-16 10:55:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(358349, 28839, 9886, '<td valign="top">Bee youtiful! This is a peach - 8</td>', 'Bee youtiful! This is a peach - 8', '2003-07-16 10:58:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(358350, 29153, 9886, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous colours and great composure, I like it! 8.</td>', 'Gorgeous colours and great composure, I like it! 8.', '2003-07-16 10:59:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(358351, 28788, 9810, '<td valign="top">What does this have to do with the challange?</td>', 'What does this have to do with the challange?', '2003-07-16 10:59:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(358352, 28784, 9810, '<td valign="top">This is kinda pushing it, isnt it? Your subject oesnt really have anything to do with round.</td>', 'This is kinda pushing it, isnt it? Your subject oesnt really have anything to do with round.', '2003-07-16 11:01:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(358354, 29014, 9810, '<td valign="top">I like the way the light shines on the marble and thru it, very nice use of light.</td>', 'I like the way the light shines on the marble and thru it, very nice use of light.', '2003-07-16 11:02:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(358355, 28384, 9810, '<td valign="top">I like the way the light shines on the discs.</td>', 'I like the way the light shines on the discs.', '2003-07-16 11:03:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(358356, 28419, 9810, '<td valign="top">This photo would be better if the light shone equally on all the coins.</td>', 'This photo would be better if the light shone equally on all the coins.', '2003-07-16 11:04:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(358357, 29061, 9810, '<td valign="top">I dont get the title, and as there really isnt anything round in the photo it doesnt make sense to me.</td>', 'I dont get the title, and as there really isnt anything round in the photo it doesnt make sense to me.', '2003-07-16 11:05:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(358359, 29019, 9886, '<td valign="top">Lurvely lines, flows through the picture a treat. Very round, 8.</td>', 'Lurvely lines, flows through the picture a treat. Very round, 8.', '2003-07-16 11:05:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(358360, 28867, 9810, '<td valign="top">This is kinda weird, because on the main page you cant see the rest of his web. This is a really cool photo, and your really lucky you got the spider in the middle.</td>', 'This is kinda weird, because on the main page you cant see the rest of his web. This is a really cool photo, and your really lucky you got the spider in the middle.', '2003-07-16 11:05:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(358361, 29072, 7570, '<td valign="top">aargh...the focus! pls work on the focus. I like this shot for the colours but the focus just dont cut it for me. 7</td>', 'aargh...the focus! pls work on the focus. I like this shot for the colours but the focus just dont cut it for me. 7', '2003-07-16 11:06:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(358362, 28985, 9810, '<td valign="top">West nile hazard, lol. You should have cleaned the middle out, I think that would have made the photo better.</td>', 'West nile hazard, lol. You should have cleaned the middle out, I think that would have made the photo better.', '2003-07-16 11:06:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(358363, 29172, 7570, '<td valign="top">the chipped one gives character. 7</td>', 'the chipped one gives character. 7', '2003-07-16 11:07:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(358364, 28537, 9886, '<td valign="top">Great, disortions all over the shop, and I love the contrast between inside and outside the mirror. 8.</td>', 'Great, disortions all over the shop, and I love the contrast between inside and outside the mirror. 8.', '2003-07-16 11:07:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(358365, 28228, 9810, '<td valign="top">I dont get it, what does this have to do with the challange, although its a cool picture perhaps it could''ve been saved for another challange.</td>', 'I dont get it, what does this have to do with the challange, although its a cool picture perhaps it could''ve been saved for another challange.', '2003-07-16 11:07:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(358368, 28082, 9504, '<td valign="top">The shadowing appears dark to me on the top of the ball.  It is distracting.  You want to move it to see it better.</td>', 'The shadowing appears dark to me on the top of the ball.  It is distracting.  You want to move it to see it better.', '2003-07-16 11:08:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(358369, 28304, 8522, '<td valign="top">That may be, but I don''t think it''s entering the spirit of the challenge which was to explore roundness, not take photos of things which happen to have some small round things on them. Nice photo though! 5</td>', 'That may be, but I don''t think it''s entering the spirit of the challenge which was to explore roundness, not take photos of things which happen to have some small round things on them. Nice photo though! 5', '2003-07-16 11:09:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(358370, 28924, 9810, '<td valign="top">This would''ve been better if you hadnt gotten the red building in the photo. Its also a bummer that the day wasnt a little nicer. What happened to the left side of the photo, to me it seems out of focus.</td>', 'This would''ve been better if you hadnt gotten the red building in the photo. Its also a bummer that the day wasnt a little nicer. What happened to the left side of the photo, to me it seems out of focus.', '2003-07-16 11:09:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(358373, 29162, 9810, '<td valign="top">Well, this doesnt really strike my fancy, sorry.</td>', 'Well, this doesnt really strike my fancy, sorry.', '2003-07-16 11:10:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(358375, 28421, 8522, '<td valign="top">Yes, very similar to mine which seems to be dying! Bloomin'' DPC. Anyway, interesting lighting, contact lenses do indeed have roundness. Nice colours on your background. Interesting angle... but too centred for my taste. Shame about the noise levels. 7</td>', 'Yes, very similar to mine which seems to be dying! Bloomin'' DPC. Anyway, interesting lighting, contact lenses do indeed have roundness. Nice colours on your background. Interesting angle... but too centred for my taste. Shame about the noise levels. 7', '2003-07-16 11:11:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(358376, 28937, 9504, '<td valign="top">The photo looks a little over-exposed to me. There is very little color with all those flowers.</td>', 'The photo looks a little over-exposed to me. There is very little color with all those flowers.', '2003-07-16 11:11:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(358377, 28580, 9810, '<td valign="top">I''m not hot on the border you put on it, and it would have been better if the flower were more spirical.</td>', 'I''m not hot on the border you put on it, and it would have been better if the flower were more spirical.', '2003-07-16 11:11:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(358379, 29121, 9810, '<td valign="top">I like how the hay is in many sicrles, I also like how his hand sinks in.</td>', 'I like how the hay is in many sicrles, I also like how his hand sinks in.', '2003-07-16 11:12:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(358380, 28770, 8522, '<td valign="top">The egg is too centred for my taste, other than that a very nice shot. Interesting textures and lighting. I really don''t like those borders though. 7</td>', 'The egg is too centred for my taste, other than that a very nice shot. Interesting textures and lighting. I really don''t like those borders though. 7', '2003-07-16 11:12:09.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(358381, 28784, 9504, '<td valign="top">Beautiful photo of the house, but the round part doesn''t quite count...</td>', 'Beautiful photo of the house, but the round part doesn''t quite count...', '2003-07-16 11:12:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(358382, 28408, 9810, '<td valign="top">Natures amazing isnt it. Nice picture</td>', 'Natures amazing isnt it. Nice picture', '2003-07-16 11:12:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(358383, 28341, 9810, '<td valign="top">Natures amazing, isnt it? Nice picture.</td>', 'Natures amazing, isnt it? Nice picture.', '2003-07-16 11:12:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(358384, 28408, 8522, '<td valign="top">Hmm, I''ve seen this picture a lot of times, usually a lot sharper! Next time try extending the dof, make sure there''s no wind and use a tripod. Try to find a fresh angle on it as well! 6</td>', 'Hmm, I''ve seen this picture a lot of times, usually a lot sharper! Next time try extending the dof, make sure there''s no wind and use a tripod. Try to find a fresh angle on it as well! 6', '2003-07-16 11:13:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(358385, 28805, 9810, '<td valign="top">Hey, a ring sizer!My grandpa has one of those. You should have had them all on one side of the ring.</td>', 'Hey, a ring sizer!My grandpa has one of those. You should have had them all on one side of the ring.', '2003-07-16 11:13:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(358386, 29157, 8522, '<td valign="top">Very entertaining, shame about the harsh shadow from the lady on the right.Great character shot. 8</td>', 'Very entertaining, shame about the harsh shadow from the lady on the right.Great character shot. 8', '2003-07-16 11:15:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(358393, 28364, 9504, '<td valign="top">The flowers are a little dark...</td>', 'The flowers are a little dark...', '2003-07-16 11:17:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(358394, 29126, 8522, '<td valign="top">Shame about the building at the bottom left. Great clouds in the background. The placement of the flag looks accidental rather than deliberate, and is not helped by the poor light in the foreground of the building. Nice architectural shot though. 7</td>', 'Shame about the building at the bottom left. Great clouds in the background. The placement of the flag looks accidental rather than deliberate, and is not helped by the poor light in the foreground of the building. Nice architectural shot though. 7', '2003-07-16 11:17:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(358396, 29105, 8522, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colours, shame about the glare which really detracts. The composition seems a bit off... I''d have prefered more bold placing of the bowl within the crop, ie centre, corner, one of the 3rds, etc. 6</td>', 'Beautiful colours, shame about the glare which really detracts. The composition seems a bit off... I''d have prefered more bold placing of the bowl within the crop, ie centre, corner, one of the 3rds, etc. 6', '2003-07-16 11:19:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(358397, 29176, 8522, '<td valign="top">Oh that plate is beautiful. Uncomfortable with existing artwork though. Nice background, great dof. 7</td>', 'Oh that plate is beautiful. Uncomfortable with existing artwork though. Nice background, great dof. 7', '2003-07-16 11:20:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(358399, 28865, 7504, '<td valign="top">I''d like this better without the rounded lens.  I really like the big round rock thing though!</td>', 'I''d like this better without the rounded lens.  I really like the big round rock thing though!', '2003-07-16 11:20:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(358400, 28289, 8522, '<td valign="top">I have a smile here after laughing out loud! Bit too much of a snapshot for my liking though. 5</td>', 'I have a smile here after laughing out loud! Bit too much of a snapshot for my liking though. 5', '2003-07-16 11:21:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(358402, 28843, 7504, '<td valign="top">Seems a bit over-exposed.  The flash is kind of harsh, you might do better with more light and no flash.</td>', 'Seems a bit over-exposed.  The flash is kind of harsh, you might do better with more light and no flash.', '2003-07-16 11:21:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(358407, 28587, 7504, '<td valign="top">This is nicely done, not my favorite subject, but the lighting and set-up is lovely.</td>', 'This is nicely done, not my favorite subject, but the lighting and set-up is lovely.', '2003-07-16 11:24:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(358409, 28081, 7504, '<td valign="top">I think I would have liked this better if it was more straight on.  Or perhaps you were tilting it like the tilt of the earth?  If so, good choice.  What do I know!</td>', 'I think I would have liked this better if it was more straight on.  Or perhaps you were tilting it like the tilt of the earth?  If so, good choice.  What do I know!', '2003-07-16 11:25:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(358411, 28420, 7504, '<td valign="top">This seems very grainy, maybe that is intentional.  I like the focus of your shot!</td>', 'This seems very grainy, maybe that is intentional.  I like the focus of your shot!', '2003-07-16 11:26:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(358412, 29066, 342, '<td valign="top">shouldn''t thatt be "Di"?  the plural of dice.</td>', 'shouldn''t thatt be "Di"?  the plural of dice.', '2003-07-16 11:26:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(358416, 29082, 7504, '<td valign="top">This is a very clean, nice shot, you make a rather uninteresting subject quite striking.</td>', 'This is a very clean, nice shot, you make a rather uninteresting subject quite striking.', '2003-07-16 11:28:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(358417, 28249, 7504, '<td valign="top">Ha, I love the smiley face.  Nice touch.</td>', 'Ha, I love the smiley face.  Nice touch.', '2003-07-16 11:30:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(358419, 28468, 7504, '<td valign="top">I was going to say that it looked dark, then realized it''s because it''s the last shot of the day.  I get it.  Nice.</td>', 'I was going to say that it looked dark, then realized it''s because it''s the last shot of the day.  I get it.  Nice.', '2003-07-16 11:31:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(358422, 28554, 7743, '<td valign="top">Self portrait?  Unfortunately your reflection draws attention away from the intended center of interest.</td>', 'Self portrait?  Unfortunately your reflection draws attention away from the intended center of interest.', '2003-07-16 11:33:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(358423, 28783, 8522, '<td valign="top">Great! A sun shot that explores roundness!!! Well done...<br/>Great colours, nice composition. Possibly needs a little more to hold my interest. 7</td>', 'Great! A sun shot that explores roundness!!! Well done...Great colours, nice composition. Possibly needs a little more to hold my interest. 7', '2003-07-16 11:35:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(358425, 28936, 8522, '<td valign="top">What a great idea for a subject. Unfortunately, I don''t like the background and I don''t think you chose a good time of day to take this picture. The little bit of car I can see on the left detracts rather than adds. 6</td>', 'What a great idea for a subject. Unfortunately, I don''t like the background and I don''t think you chose a good time of day to take this picture. The little bit of car I can see on the left detracts rather than adds. 6', '2003-07-16 11:36:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(358430, 28875, 8522, '<td valign="top">Wow, tricky subject to expose for and you handled it very well. Shame about the noise in the background... was this as a result of neatimage? 7</td>', 'Wow, tricky subject to expose for and you handled it very well. Shame about the noise in the background... was this as a result of neatimage? 7', '2003-07-16 11:39:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(358435, 28553, 8522, '<td valign="top">Wow, he must be on glass, and no trail either. I think the light was a bit harsh, maybe this could have worked better at the end of the day. Composition is too centred for my taste. Great idea though. 6</td>', 'Wow, he must be on glass, and no trail either. I think the light was a bit harsh, maybe this could have worked better at the end of the day. Composition is too centred for my taste. Great idea though. 6', '2003-07-16 11:42:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(358438, 28323, 8522, '<td valign="top">Wah! Those legs... *shudders*.<br/>Great colours and textures, interesting composition. The spider could have done with better lighting though. 7</td>', 'Wah! Those legs... *shudders*.Great colours and textures, interesting composition. The spider could have done with better lighting though. 7', '2003-07-16 11:44:15.000000', NULL, 1),
