(359428, 29019, 6740, '<td valign="top">Reminds me of a scenes in the movie "Star Trek the Motion Picture".  Like it.</td>', 'Reminds me of a scenes in the movie "Star Trek the Motion Picture".  Like it.', '2003-07-16 23:32:59.000000', NULL, 1),
