(359436, 28390, 1280, '<td valign="top">It''s nice but diffusing the light source would have cut down on the many reflections of light, that vie for a attention along with the subjects.  Because of the reflections it seems too busy.  <br/>Hope that helps!</td>', 'It''s nice but diffusing the light source would have cut down on the many reflections of light, that vie for a attention along with the subjects.  Because of the reflections it seems too busy.  Hope that helps!', '2003-07-16 23:38:17.000000', NULL, 1),
