(359460, 28879, 9911, '<td valign="top">Definitely says round to me. Love the composition and lighting. (10)</td>', 'Definitely says round to me. Love the composition and lighting. (10)', '2003-07-17 00:16:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(359462, 29039, 9602, '<td valign="top">need to somehow bring the moon into focus</td>', 'need to somehow bring the moon into focus', '2003-07-17 00:18:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(359463, 29018, 4375, '<td valign="top">Really like it.  It''s got movement and colour.  You made a quite ordinary object really dynamic.  Nice work!</td>', 'Really like it.  It''s got movement and colour.  You made a quite ordinary object really dynamic.  Nice work!', '2003-07-17 00:20:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(359465, 28455, 5964, '<td valign="top">Wow, what the heck is this? The colors in this shot is just amazing. I love how it glows. I guess my only suggestion would be to include the whole (ball) and not to crop the bottom off. But it still works the way it is.9.</td>', 'Wow, what the heck is this? The colors in this shot is just amazing. I love how it glows. I guess my only suggestion would be to include the whole (ball) and not to crop the bottom off. But it still works the way it is.9.', '2003-07-17 00:21:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(359466, 28928, 7778, '<td valign="top">The photo seems overly manipulated (\"pushed\") without achieving a satisfying \"external\" aesthetic. Items, in the background, remain sufficiently lighted for a conspicuous ambiguity. The edge of the frame or table top (foreground) is overexposed, rendering a distraction. Framing and composition, too, are awquard (almost corner to corner &gt; bottom left - cut off &gt; bottom right). The subject is centred, which might be justified for an object with an entirely \"contained'' dynamic and without the given larger perspective (beyond the foreground rectangle). There''s also a fair amount of noise in the photo, likely due to post processing.<br/> <br/>Despite all these apparent flaws, the capture itself is remarkable. Apart from the astounding physical feat presented here, the subject''s concentration and discipline are clearly caught. The timing of the shot, also, is marvellous (note the left hand and fingers and the perfectly tuned light on this detail). <br/> <br/>I could imagine intending to incorporate \"some\" of this capture''s flaws to place the photo within the context of an old pictorial from far-away lands... (or to hide an all to obvious talent). Still, the application of such artifacts here, if in fact there is one, is excessive.  &gt; 6</td>', 'The photo seems overly manipulated (\"pushed\") without achieving a satisfying \"external\" aesthetic. Items, in the background, remain sufficiently lighted for a conspicuous ambiguity. The edge of the frame or table top (foreground) is overexposed, rendering a distraction. Framing and composition, too, are awquard (almost corner to corner > bottom left - cut off > bottom right). The subject is centred, which might be justified for an object with an entirely \"contained'' dynamic and without the given larger perspective (beyond the foreground rectangle). There''s also a fair amount of noise in the photo, likely due to post processing. Despite all these apparent flaws, the capture itself is remarkable. Apart from the astounding physical feat presented here, the subject''s concentration and discipline are clearly caught. The timing of the shot, also, is marvellous (note the left hand and fingers and the perfectly tuned light on this detail).  I could imagine intending to incorporate \"some\" of this capture''s flaws to place the photo within the context of an old pictorial from far-away lands... (or to hide an all to obvious talent). Still, the application of such artifacts here, if in fact there is one, is excessive.  > 6', '2003-07-17 00:22:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(359467, 28453, 4375, '<td valign="top">This is nice.  I particularly like the cropping.</td>', 'This is nice.  I particularly like the cropping.', '2003-07-17 00:22:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(359468, 28324, 6938, '<td valign="top">Interesting.  I would have preferred the marbles to have been in focus rather than the reflection.</td>', 'Interesting.  I would have preferred the marbles to have been in focus rather than the reflection.', '2003-07-17 00:23:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(359469, 28566, 6938, '<td valign="top">Nice collectin of curves.  Could you have removed (what looks like) your reflection in the centre of the right speaker?</td>', 'Nice collectin of curves.  Could you have removed (what looks like) your reflection in the centre of the right speaker?', '2003-07-17 00:25:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(359470, 29072, 6938, '<td valign="top">I''ts a pity that everything isn''t closer to being in sharp focus.</td>', 'I''ts a pity that everything isn''t closer to being in sharp focus.', '2003-07-17 00:26:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(359472, 28576, 4375, '<td valign="top">really great contrast in colours and an interesting subject.  I like it a lot.</td>', 'really great contrast in colours and an interesting subject.  I like it a lot.', '2003-07-17 00:27:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(359473, 29127, 4375, '<td valign="top">This shows some beautiful design elements.  Nicely done!</td>', 'This shows some beautiful design elements.  Nicely done!', '2003-07-17 00:28:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(359474, 28587, 4805, '<td valign="top">Nice...this could contend. I really like the composition...very minimalist. One nitpick is that the depth of focus is short enough to render the closest marble slightly out of focus. I''d prefer to see either them all in focus, or one in focus and the others blurred. The very slight blur is a bit distracting...still, very nice.</td>', 'Nice...this could contend. I really like the composition...very minimalist. One nitpick is that the depth of focus is short enough to render the closest marble slightly out of focus. I''d prefer to see either them all in focus, or one in focus and the others blurred. The very slight blur is a bit distracting...still, very nice.', '2003-07-17 00:28:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(359476, 28614, 4375, '<td valign="top">WOW!</td>', 'WOW!', '2003-07-17 00:29:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(359477, 28823, 4375, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colours and composition!</td>', 'Beautiful colours and composition!', '2003-07-17 00:29:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(359479, 29142, 4375, '<td valign="top">I have no idea what this is but it is so intriging and dynamic, I like it a lot</td>', 'I have no idea what this is but it is so intriging and dynamic, I like it a lot', '2003-07-17 00:31:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(359480, 28524, 4805, '<td valign="top">Nice. Must have used a very long telephoto/telescope for this one, or you''ve got a serious amount of megapixels, or both. The composition is interesting. Personally I''d like to see the same width of black on the right side as there is top and bottom, though that''s very minor. Not sure about the title...</td>', 'Nice. Must have used a very long telephoto/telescope for this one, or you''ve got a serious amount of megapixels, or both. The composition is interesting. Personally I''d like to see the same width of black on the right side as there is top and bottom, though that''s very minor. Not sure about the title...', '2003-07-17 00:32:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(359481, 28419, 4805, '<td valign="top">Might have cropped this one closer and taken it at a higher/planimetric angle, but still a good shot. I especially like the top coin...maybe a severe crop around that one might have been interesting as well.</td>', 'Might have cropped this one closer and taken it at a higher/planimetric angle, but still a good shot. I especially like the top coin...maybe a severe crop around that one might have been interesting as well.', '2003-07-17 00:33:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(359484, 29142, 4805, '<td valign="top">If this is something functional I''ve got no idea what it could be...very nice abstract nonetheless. The lighting is perfect. Might have converted to black and white, myself...</td>', 'If this is something functional I''ve got no idea what it could be...very nice abstract nonetheless. The lighting is perfect. Might have converted to black and white, myself...', '2003-07-17 00:35:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(359486, 28770, 4805, '<td valign="top">Nice. I like the feel, though te border and the intrusion in the top right corner distracts. I''m not a big fan of this kind of border. Still, it''s well done. DOF is an unusual choice and not sure it works. I might have focused on the yolk and let the background fall out of focus, rather than rendering the middle bit most clearly.</td>', 'Nice. I like the feel, though te border and the intrusion in the top right corner distracts. I''m not a big fan of this kind of border. Still, it''s well done. DOF is an unusual choice and not sure it works. I might have focused on the yolk and let the background fall out of focus, rather than rendering the middle bit most clearly.', '2003-07-17 00:38:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(359487, 28938, 4805, '<td valign="top">Not a bad idea, though I think the very harsh light here hurts somewhat. The chromatic aberration on the hole rims is a byproduct of the harshness. You might want to convert to black and white to get rid of that effect. I''d try a more diffuse light if you''re into exploring it more.</td>', 'Not a bad idea, though I think the very harsh light here hurts somewhat. The chromatic aberration on the hole rims is a byproduct of the harshness. You might want to convert to black and white to get rid of that effect. I''d try a more diffuse light if you''re into exploring it more.', '2003-07-17 00:41:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(359488, 29014, 4258, '<td valign="top">would have liked a whiter background and a better marble</td>', 'would have liked a whiter background and a better marble', '2003-07-17 00:43:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(359489, 28587, 4258, '<td valign="top">Absolutely lovely - what was the surface?</td>', 'Absolutely lovely - what was the surface?', '2003-07-17 00:44:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(359491, 29147, 4805, '<td valign="top">Nice. I like this. Very sharp. The texture of the grass is great. One thing I might have tried is knocking down the blue and/or magenta channel to get rid of the chromatic aberration around the ball. The shot is taken facing the light source, which works here for the grass, but the ball comes out a bit hot.</td>', 'Nice. I like this. Very sharp. The texture of the grass is great. One thing I might have tried is knocking down the blue and/or magenta channel to get rid of the chromatic aberration around the ball. The shot is taken facing the light source, which works here for the grass, but the ball comes out a bit hot.', '2003-07-17 00:46:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(359492, 29158, 4258, '<td valign="top">Cork ball?</td>', 'Cork ball?', '2003-07-17 00:46:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(359494, 28812, 4258, '<td valign="top">Nice composition - I almost did  the same for "One ring to bind them all"</td>', 'Nice composition - I almost did  the same for "One ring to bind them all"', '2003-07-17 00:46:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(359496, 29196, 4805, '<td valign="top">Nice...good light, colour, composition. My only nipick is the edge at the bottom. I''d knock it out, personally. It''s curved (might be pincushioning from the lens) and distracts. The scene would appear much more stable without it.</td>', 'Nice...good light, colour, composition. My only nipick is the edge at the bottom. I''d knock it out, personally. It''s curved (might be pincushioning from the lens) and distracts. The scene would appear much more stable without it.', '2003-07-17 00:48:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(359497, 29072, 4805, '<td valign="top">Focus is a bit soft, you''ll get hammered for it. This kind of shot does well when everything''s sharp. Nice idea, good colours. Did you try a low-angle across them? Might be interesting.</td>', 'Focus is a bit soft, you''ll get hammered for it. This kind of shot does well when everything''s sharp. Nice idea, good colours. Did you try a low-angle across them? Might be interesting.', '2003-07-17 00:49:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(359499, 29089, 4375, '<td valign="top">I do like this however I think I''d like just a little more definition to focus in on.</td>', 'I do like this however I think I''d like just a little more definition to focus in on.', '2003-07-17 00:50:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(359502, 28875, 4805, '<td valign="top">Nice and sharp. Great tones. Interesting? Not overly...might get hurt in the voting there. A closer crop might be fun to try, too.</td>', 'Nice and sharp. Great tones. Interesting? Not overly...might get hurt in the voting there. A closer crop might be fun to try, too.', '2003-07-17 00:52:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(359504, 28865, 4805, '<td valign="top">Very nice. Great sharpness, tones, colour. I love the lighting. I also like how the horizon is carefully considered. I don''t know why but I thought of the game ''Myst'' as soon as I saw it. Looks like it belongs there. I hope this does well, there''s nothing I would change.</td>', 'Very nice. Great sharpness, tones, colour. I love the lighting. I also like how the horizon is carefully considered. I don''t know why but I thought of the game ''Myst'' as soon as I saw it. Looks like it belongs there. I hope this does well, there''s nothing I would change.', '2003-07-17 00:54:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(359512, 28455, 4805, '<td valign="top">Ooooh, very nice. Excellent exposure, composition, border, colour and idea. Love it, nothing wrong with it, you''ll win a ribbon or my name''s mud. Thank you, frivolous Sharper Image purchase circa 1987.</td>', 'Ooooh, very nice. Excellent exposure, composition, border, colour and idea. Love it, nothing wrong with it, you''ll win a ribbon or my name''s mud. Thank you, frivolous Sharper Image purchase circa 1987.', '2003-07-17 00:57:40.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(359513, 29077, 4258, '<td valign="top">Two ladies and a gent ? Kinky ;)  Like the pic</td>', 'Two ladies and a gent ? Kinky ;)  Like the pic', '2003-07-17 00:58:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(359515, 28892, 4805, '<td valign="top">Like it...soft, round. You''ll get hammered for the soft focus and the grain but for me it works. Very expressive for just an eye, cheek and a nose.</td>', 'Like it...soft, round. You''ll get hammered for the soft focus and the grain but for me it works. Very expressive for just an eye, cheek and a nose.', '2003-07-17 00:59:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(359517, 28556, 4805, '<td valign="top">Nice, though I''d personally make the image as large as possible...at least 640 on a side.</td>', 'Nice, though I''d personally make the image as large as possible...at least 640 on a side.', '2003-07-17 01:00:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(359519, 28390, 4258, '<td valign="top">Coca Cola Marble!! That is so 70s, you are in wrong challenge!! ;)</td>', 'Coca Cola Marble!! That is so 70s, you are in wrong challenge!! ;)', '2003-07-17 01:06:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(359522, 28883, 9918, '<td valign="top">Ohhhhhhhhhhh......</td>', 'Ohhhhhhhhhhh......', '2003-07-17 01:09:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(359525, 28095, 4967, '<td valign="top">I loved the Devil''s Marbles... what a beautiful sight they were just as the sun was going down :-)  I think this would have filled the frame more, and been better maybe as a horizontal picture with less in the foreground and less in the background... filling the frame would have been nice.  Also the main focus here is very centered which is kind of boring.  Love that place though :-) OZ... I mmiss OZ!</td>', 'I loved the Devil''s Marbles... what a beautiful sight they were just as the sun was going down :-)  I think this would have filled the frame more, and been better maybe as a horizontal picture with less in the foreground and less in the background... filling the frame would have been nice.  Also the main focus here is very centered which is kind of boring.  Love that place though :-) OZ... I mmiss OZ!', '2003-07-17 01:27:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(359527, 29138, 4967, '<td valign="top">I love the leading lines going towards the main subject... the round ball.  The ball looks maybe a tad bit hot, but it''s not too bothersome.  I like the negative space at the upper right corner... nice how there is more space there and less on the bottom... gives it a not so centered look.  A nice image... well lit... good job</td>', 'I love the leading lines going towards the main subject... the round ball.  The ball looks maybe a tad bit hot, but it''s not too bothersome.  I like the negative space at the upper right corner... nice how there is more space there and less on the bottom... gives it a not so centered look.  A nice image... well lit... good job', '2003-07-17 01:32:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(359535, 28706, 6938, '<td valign="top">How did this look in colour?</td>', 'How did this look in colour?', '2003-07-17 02:25:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(359537, 28883, 8455, '<td valign="top">These guys are soooo cute/cool/interesting ... they look both like a sculpture, and like figures out of a childrens novel.  Excellent composition, too.  (I actually looked at this one, and before seeing the title, went "oooooooh".)</td>', 'These guys are soooo cute/cool/interesting ... they look both like a sculpture, and like figures out of a childrens novel.  Excellent composition, too.  (I actually looked at this one, and before seeing the title, went "oooooooh".)', '2003-07-17 02:26:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(359538, 29055, 6938, '<td valign="top">A very interesting concept, the reflecting table(?)top adds to the charactor of the shot.  The execution has left a lot to be desired though -  The background is distracting and could have been removed (a simple sheet), The reflections of the room are the same,  as well as the reflections of you taking the photo. A winning idea, but it needs a lot of polishing.</td>', 'A very interesting concept, the reflecting table(?)top adds to the charactor of the shot.  The execution has left a lot to be desired though -  The background is distracting and could have been removed (a simple sheet), The reflections of the room are the same,  as well as the reflections of you taking the photo. A winning idea, but it needs a lot of polishing.', '2003-07-17 02:31:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(359539, 28939, 7396, '<td valign="top">i love this! i wish the black dots were bolder .... more black. a tad more contrasty- i still like it though! 7</td>', 'i love this! i wish the black dots were bolder .... more black. a tad more contrasty- i still like it though! 7', '2003-07-17 02:33:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(359540, 28756, 7396, '<td valign="top">this is beautiful- i would put this in my kitchen- 5ftx7ft!- the bottom left to center could be a bit sharper.. but still like it....8</td>', 'this is beautiful- i would put this in my kitchen- 5ftx7ft!- the bottom left to center could be a bit sharper.. but still like it....8', '2003-07-17 02:38:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(359541, 28420, 7396, '<td valign="top">ok..soooo what is round in this pix? hmmmmm......</td>', 'ok..soooo what is round in this pix? hmmmmm......', '2003-07-17 02:39:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(359544, 29134, 7396, '<td valign="top">i like this....u should put this on canvas!</td>', 'i like this....u should put this on canvas!', '2003-07-17 02:43:27.000000', NULL, 1),
