(359562, 29083, 4514, '<td valign="top">1)Does the shot fit the Challenge? I would say yes (5)<br/>2)Photo Color: Color is decent(5)<br/>3)Composition: I think the composition is a little week here.  (4)<br/>4)Focus: Focus on the Focal point seems to be good.(6)<br/>5)Background. (4)<br/>6)Lighting.  Lighting is what really hurt you. (3)<br/> <br/> <br/>Conclusion:<br/> <br/>I think the biggest issue with this shot is the lighting.  I think a bit more light at would allow for you to read the bottom of the water Jug.  I do however think that you had an idea here.  It could have been executed a little better in my oppinion.<br/> <br/>Overall Score: 4.5 Rounded to 5.0<br/> <br/> <br/> <br/>John (TurboTech)</td>', '1)Does the shot fit the Challenge? I would say yes (5)2)Photo Color: Color is decent(5)3)Composition: I think the composition is a little week here.  (4)4)Focus: Focus on the Focal point seems to be good.(6)5)Background. (4)6)Lighting.  Lighting is what really hurt you. (3)  Conclusion: I think the biggest issue with this shot is the lighting.  I think a bit more light at would allow for you to read the bottom of the water Jug.  I do however think that you had an idea here.  It could have been executed a little better in my oppinion. Overall Score: 4.5 Rounded to 5.0   John (TurboTech)', '2003-07-17 03:51:02.000000', NULL, 1),
