(359573, 29142, 9911, '<td valign="top">Interesting. I really like this shot. What a cool idea. How did you do it? You''ve definitely hit the nail on the head with the subject choice for this challenge....it''s roundness within roundness. Can''t get much clearer than that!! The only two things stopping me from giving it a perfect 10 is that the balls at the top have been cropped out a little too much (would have liked to have seen all 7) and the balls closer to the light aren''t in focus. A (9) from me anyway. Good luck.</td>', 'Interesting. I really like this shot. What a cool idea. How did you do it? You''ve definitely hit the nail on the head with the subject choice for this challenge....it''s roundness within roundness. Can''t get much clearer than that!! The only two things stopping me from giving it a perfect 10 is that the balls at the top have been cropped out a little too much (would have liked to have seen all 7) and the balls closer to the light aren''t in focus. A (9) from me anyway. Good luck.', '2003-07-17 04:13:41.000000', NULL, 1),
