(359583, 28867, 8298, '<td valign="top">one of my favorite shots of the challenge. good orientation shift. provides new perspective on a tradition theme (vertical spider positioning). focus is perfect. great use of shallow depth. off centering brings attention to both the spider and the web. brilliant. spider is facing bottom left, gives technical merrit, lost marks for a slight under-application of the challenge theme. , but otherwise, this shot deserves a ribbon for another challenge. 8, but one of my personal favorites on this site.</td>', 'one of my favorite shots of the challenge. good orientation shift. provides new perspective on a tradition theme (vertical spider positioning). focus is perfect. great use of shallow depth. off centering brings attention to both the spider and the web. brilliant. spider is facing bottom left, gives technical merrit, lost marks for a slight under-application of the challenge theme. , but otherwise, this shot deserves a ribbon for another challenge. 8, but one of my personal favorites on this site.', '2003-07-17 04:30:15.000000', NULL, 1),
