(359857, 29013, 772, '<td valign="top">Interesting photo and poor title.  "Pandering" in the title is sure to get you in trouble.  I think this is the beginning of a good photo.  The lighting isn''t working.. looks like an on cam flash probably.  Natural lighting may not have been possible, and if so, maybe a different subject choice would have worked out better for you...</td>', 'Interesting photo and poor title.  "Pandering" in the title is sure to get you in trouble.  I think this is the beginning of a good photo.  The lighting isn''t working.. looks like an on cam flash probably.  Natural lighting may not have been possible, and if so, maybe a different subject choice would have worked out better for you...', '2003-07-17 13:45:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(359860, 29168, 772, '<td valign="top">The concept behind this photo is quite strong and the idea is good.  I don''t traditionally thing of golf balls as having a yellow tint.  This is probalby cause by white balance issues and could be corrected rather easily also.  This image should probably also be sharp instead of out of focus.  I can''t see how the choice to make this soft focus is really helping the image.</td>', 'The concept behind this photo is quite strong and the idea is good.  I don''t traditionally thing of golf balls as having a yellow tint.  This is probalby cause by white balance issues and could be corrected rather easily also.  This image should probably also be sharp instead of out of focus.  I can''t see how the choice to make this soft focus is really helping the image.', '2003-07-17 13:46:39.000000', NULL, 1),
