(359917, 28562, 7857, '<td valign="top">Nice use of duotone, not sure about the crop... i think the sharp cut off below the white strip looks a bit off, but then doing it higher may be the wrong way to go... oh i dunno, nice shot, good luck.</td>', 'Nice use of duotone, not sure about the crop... i think the sharp cut off below the white strip looks a bit off, but then doing it higher may be the wrong way to go... oh i dunno, nice shot, good luck.', '2003-07-17 15:16:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(359920, 28552, 7857, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot, good use of B+W, really nice light and brilliant DOF.</td>', 'Very nice shot, good use of B+W, really nice light and brilliant DOF.', '2003-07-17 15:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(359930, 28162, 7743, '<td valign="top">Your idea is good.  The choice of a ringed glass adds interest.  Anything white can be difficult to photograph since the meter in your camera will be fooled into trying to make it grey as it has here (18% grey).  Adding between 1.5 and 2 stops of exposure would have helped here.</td>', 'Your idea is good.  The choice of a ringed glass adds interest.  Anything white can be difficult to photograph since the meter in your camera will be fooled into trying to make it grey as it has here (18% grey).  Adding between 1.5 and 2 stops of exposure would have helped here.', '2003-07-17 15:32:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(359932, 28304, 7743, '<td valign="top">This is a good macro image but it just doesn''t say round to me.  Yes there are round areas within the image but the eye is drawn to the body of the butterfly and the flower.</td>', 'This is a good macro image but it just doesn''t say round to me.  Yes there are round areas within the image but the eye is drawn to the body of the butterfly and the flower.', '2003-07-17 15:35:15.000000', NULL, 1),
