(360134, 28353, 1005, '<td valign="top">Nice marigold.  It''s sort of round, the nitpickers are going to have a field day with you.  The image seems very small, so it''s hard to make out the details.  The leaves at the middle distance to the ground seem strongly in focus (more than the flower).  Good color!  6 Rob the Swash</td>', 'Nice marigold.  It''s sort of round, the nitpickers are going to have a field day with you.  The image seems very small, so it''s hard to make out the details.  The leaves at the middle distance to the ground seem strongly in focus (more than the flower).  Good color!  6 Rob the Swash', '2003-07-17 20:13:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(360136, 29089, 1005, '<td valign="top">Very high key sort of view.  IMHO, these type shots don''t do well.  I wish you luck.  I''m not really thrilled with this...you know exactly what this is, so your eyes would tend to "fill in the details", but as I don''t have your eyes, I just don''t see enough information to form an opinion of quality.  6 Rob the Swash</td>', 'Very high key sort of view.  IMHO, these type shots don''t do well.  I wish you luck.  I''m not really thrilled with this...you know exactly what this is, so your eyes would tend to "fill in the details", but as I don''t have your eyes, I just don''t see enough information to form an opinion of quality.  6 Rob the Swash', '2003-07-17 20:17:22.000000', NULL, 1),
