(360144, 28934, 1005, '<td valign="top">Pretty yellow flower!  Good focus and color.  Your title says to me "tight circle", but the flower isn''t a tight circle, even if it basically circular - challenge accepted, but I''d suggest a different title.  The cropping cuts off the circular pattern even more.  As much as I like this flower, the best I can go is a 6.  Rob the Swash</td>', 'Pretty yellow flower!  Good focus and color.  Your title says to me "tight circle", but the flower isn''t a tight circle, even if it basically circular - challenge accepted, but I''d suggest a different title.  The cropping cuts off the circular pattern even more.  As much as I like this flower, the best I can go is a 6.  Rob the Swash', '2003-07-17 20:21:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(360149, 28783, 1005, '<td valign="top">It''s a cool effect, really fun coloration.  The tree bark (I think, it''s hard to tell for certain) is a good contrast to the soft, smooth sky.....but I like detail over pretty colors (sorry, my bad).  6 Rob the Swash</td>', 'It''s a cool effect, really fun coloration.  The tree bark (I think, it''s hard to tell for certain) is a good contrast to the soft, smooth sky.....but I like detail over pretty colors (sorry, my bad).  6 Rob the Swash', '2003-07-17 20:25:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(360155, 28289, 7628, '<td valign="top">What an irresistable puppy!  Look at those pleading eyes.  This would make a better portrait with better light (outdoors? you would get more detail of the dogs body and his expression) and a less cluttered background.  Crop in on the subject - the dog and his toy.</td>', 'What an irresistable puppy!  Look at those pleading eyes.  This would make a better portrait with better light (outdoors? you would get more detail of the dogs body and his expression) and a less cluttered background.  Crop in on the subject - the dog and his toy.', '2003-07-17 20:30:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(360159, 29168, 1005, '<td valign="top">IMHO, this is just too close.  I get the sense of round, yes, but the focus isn''t tack sharp (needs to be for this one).  The lighting ranges from O.K. to harsh (on top), which completely wipes out any detail up there.  5 Rob the Swash</td>', 'IMHO, this is just too close.  I get the sense of round, yes, but the focus isn''t tack sharp (needs to be for this one).  The lighting ranges from O.K. to harsh (on top), which completely wipes out any detail up there.  5 Rob the Swash', '2003-07-17 20:31:33.000000', NULL, 1),
