(360166, 28420, 1005, '<td valign="top">Cool effect, in general, I like this pic.  (Just making sure - is the round part the hole we are looking through to see the lighthouse or the lighthouse itself?)  IMHO, I don''t think the sun up top helps, a manual crop w/o it looks better to me - the sun draws my eyes away from the high key lighthouse.  6 Rob the Swash</td>', 'Cool effect, in general, I like this pic.  (Just making sure - is the round part the hole we are looking through to see the lighthouse or the lighthouse itself?)  IMHO, I don''t think the sun up top helps, a manual crop w/o it looks better to me - the sun draws my eyes away from the high key lighthouse.  6 Rob the Swash', '2003-07-17 20:35:39.000000', NULL, 1),
