(360497, 28179, 7966, '<td valign="top">an old tire i''m guessing, I get that it''s technically round but i don''t see the roundness. the photo isn''t really that nice to look at, it''s very plain. i think this all could have been fixed by a slight change in a perspective and composition.</td>', 'an old tire i''m guessing, I get that it''s technically round but i don''t see the roundness. the photo isn''t really that nice to look at, it''s very plain. i think this all could have been fixed by a slight change in a perspective and composition.', '2003-07-18 02:53:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(360498, 28822, 7966, '<td valign="top">I would have liked to have seen something other than white for the background otherwise great photo</td>', 'I would have liked to have seen something other than white for the background otherwise great photo', '2003-07-18 02:55:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(360499, 28453, 7966, '<td valign="top">nice photo, fits the challenge well. 8.</td>', 'nice photo, fits the challenge well. 8.', '2003-07-18 02:56:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(360500, 29168, 4514, '<td valign="top">Does the shot fit the Challenge (8)<br/>Photo Color (3)<br/>Composition(3)<br/>Focus(4)<br/>Background(4)<br/>Lighting(3)<br/> <br/>Conclusion:<br/>The Theme is round and you have captured that here.  I would say that I think the color is not very good and that may be due to poor white balance choice.  You took this shot from an wierd perspective and I think it does not suit well.  One of the only times you will ever hear me say go wider angle.  I do not know what you were trying to achieve with this focus but it is very soft.   The background in itself can barely be seen so there is not contrast.  The lighting is nothign to write home about.  Looks like Normal house lighting.  For something like this I woudl have tried to suspend the ball and make it look like it was just levitating.  I guess I am just a weakling for special effects.    <br/> <br/>Overall Score(4)<br/> <br/></td>', 'Does the shot fit the Challenge (8)Photo Color (3)Composition(3)Focus(4)Background(4)Lighting(3) Conclusion:The Theme is round and you have captured that here.  I would say that I think the color is not very good and that may be due to poor white balance choice.  You took this shot from an wierd perspective and I think it does not suit well.  One of the only times you will ever hear me say go wider angle.  I do not know what you were trying to achieve with this focus but it is very soft.   The background in itself can barely be seen so there is not contrast.  The lighting is nothign to write home about.  Looks like Normal house lighting.  For something like this I woudl have tried to suspend the ball and make it look like it was just levitating.  I guess I am just a weakling for special effects.     Overall Score(4) ', '2003-07-18 02:57:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(360501, 28567, 7966, '<td valign="top">i like the contrast in colors, it adds a nice touch. all the elements of this shot are perfect. good job. 9</td>', 'i like the contrast in colors, it adds a nice touch. all the elements of this shot are perfect. good job. 9', '2003-07-18 02:58:37.000000', NULL, 1),
