(360506, 28622, 4514, '<td valign="top">Does the shot fit the Challenge (6)<br/>Photo Color (6)<br/>Composition(4)<br/>Focus(7)<br/>Background(3)<br/>Lighting(4)<br/> <br/>Conclusion:<br/>I believe this does fit the challenge with some respect.  I do feel however that there were better formations you could have tried.  The color is vibrant and I would say accurate.  Focus on this shot is very sharp and that is one of ist particular strong points.  Background does not really exist so it causes a bit of an eyestrain.  The lighting is a bit harsh.  Was this taken outside or inside.<br/> <br/> <br/>Overall Score(5)<br/> <br/></td>', 'Does the shot fit the Challenge (6)Photo Color (6)Composition(4)Focus(7)Background(3)Lighting(4) Conclusion:I believe this does fit the challenge with some respect.  I do feel however that there were better formations you could have tried.  The color is vibrant and I would say accurate.  Focus on this shot is very sharp and that is one of ist particular strong points.  Background does not really exist so it causes a bit of an eyestrain.  The lighting is a bit harsh.  Was this taken outside or inside.  Overall Score(5) ', '2003-07-18 03:12:42.000000', NULL, 1),
