(360570, 28881, 4008, '<td valign="top">The best advise I ever got on one of my pictures was to use my imagination next time. I would like to give the same advice to you, you can still use the cookies but don''t take just a straight flash shot with the cookies right in the middle and lots of uninteresting space around it. Try something different. Hope this triggers you as it did me (although the remark initially might irritate)</td>', 'The best advise I ever got on one of my pictures was to use my imagination next time. I would like to give the same advice to you, you can still use the cookies but don''t take just a straight flash shot with the cookies right in the middle and lots of uninteresting space around it. Try something different. Hope this triggers you as it did me (although the remark initially might irritate)', '2003-07-18 08:08:22.000000', NULL, 1),
