(361010, 28980, 9337, '<td valign="top">Very creative. I like the lighting.</td>', 'Very creative. I like the lighting.', '2003-07-18 21:09:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(361012, 28401, 9337, '<td valign="top">Whoa very space ship like.</td>', 'Whoa very space ship like.', '2003-07-18 21:10:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(361029, 29013, 4514, '<td valign="top">Intresting lines.  I do however feel that the viewpoint could be changed to serve this focal point a little better.  Lighting is a bit harsh.  I would personally back away and Turn slightly to the left or right and put the wheel at one of the four quadrants.  That woudl dramatically change the composition and effectively please the eye a little bit more.  You are on to something here.  <br/> <br/></td>', 'Intresting lines.  I do however feel that the viewpoint could be changed to serve this focal point a little better.  Lighting is a bit harsh.  I would personally back away and Turn slightly to the left or right and put the wheel at one of the four quadrants.  That woudl dramatically change the composition and effectively please the eye a little bit more.  You are on to something here.   ', '2003-07-18 22:11:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(361030, 29164, 4514, '<td valign="top">This is a cute shot.  Very sharp.  Besides it is making me hungry.  Light is a bit bright, but I assume you used the cam flash.  It meets the round challenge.  I do not know what I would have tried here.  Something way different.</td>', 'This is a cute shot.  Very sharp.  Besides it is making me hungry.  Light is a bit bright, but I assume you used the cam flash.  It meets the round challenge.  I do not know what I would have tried here.  Something way different.', '2003-07-18 22:16:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(361031, 28756, 4514, '<td valign="top">Ok.  Now this green ball is a bit out of place I would say.  I think you are a bit too close for the lens that you are using.  This kind of reminds me of the movie "The Attack of the Killer Tomatoes."  What is in the background?</td>', 'Ok.  Now this green ball is a bit out of place I would say.  I think you are a bit too close for the lens that you are using.  This kind of reminds me of the movie "The Attack of the Killer Tomatoes."  What is in the background?', '2003-07-18 22:18:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(361032, 28838, 4514, '<td valign="top">Ok.  Is this the hand of a baby or a small person.  Notice the fingernails.  They kind of look groomed.  As far as the idea of Food.  I do not know about that.  LOL  Very sharp.</td>', 'Ok.  Is this the hand of a baby or a small person.  Notice the fingernails.  They kind of look groomed.  As far as the idea of Food.  I do not know about that.  LOL  Very sharp.', '2003-07-18 22:19:53.000000', NULL, 1),
