(361293, 28465, 7151, '<td valign="top">I don''t like the title, given that it''s in B&amp;W, and I don''t like the eyes looking away, since that detracts from the roundest parts of the eye.  The photo''s OK, but doesn''t really grab me.  It''s a little too soft for me.</td>', 'I don''t like the title, given that it''s in B&W, and I don''t like the eyes looking away, since that detracts from the roundest parts of the eye.  The photo''s OK, but doesn''t really grab me.  It''s a little too soft for me.', '2003-07-19 20:54:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(361294, 28309, 9337, '<td valign="top">Neat colors. The angle of tilt seems strange to me.</td>', 'Neat colors. The angle of tilt seems strange to me.', '2003-07-19 20:54:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(361295, 28410, 9885, '<td valign="top">If more of the big round buds (or whatever they are) were in focus I think the shot would have much more impact.I love the texture of the flattened grass.</td>', 'If more of the big round buds (or whatever they are) were in focus I think the shot would have much more impact.I love the texture of the flattened grass.', '2003-07-19 20:54:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(361296, 28933, 7151, '<td valign="top">Ha!  Had the same idea!  But I was going to try to do it with the wheels actually going around - but I was afraid I''d get in a wreck!  I think more of the wheel would have made the composition a little better.  Focus is good, sharpness is OK, colors are interesting.</td>', 'Ha!  Had the same idea!  But I was going to try to do it with the wheels actually going around - but I was afraid I''d get in a wreck!  I think more of the wheel would have made the composition a little better.  Focus is good, sharpness is OK, colors are interesting.', '2003-07-19 20:56:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(361297, 28364, 9337, '<td valign="top">This picture seems a bit too underexposed. It might be nice to pic one of the flowers as a main subject, there doesn''t seem to be a focal point in this shot.</td>', 'This picture seems a bit too underexposed. It might be nice to pic one of the flowers as a main subject, there doesn''t seem to be a focal point in this shot.', '2003-07-19 20:56:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(361298, 28186, 9885, '<td valign="top">with the theme "Round" in mind, maybe if you cropped most of the bottom half of the picture and left just the small domes and large dome, then I feel it would have more impact.</td>', 'with the theme "Round" in mind, maybe if you cropped most of the bottom half of the picture and left just the small domes and large dome, then I feel it would have more impact.', '2003-07-19 20:56:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(361299, 28939, 9337, '<td valign="top">Wow! I''d love to see a how you did this shot tutorial. That dorplet is really cool. One of my favorite shots so far.</td>', 'Wow! I''d love to see a how you did this shot tutorial. That dorplet is really cool. One of my favorite shots so far.', '2003-07-19 20:57:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(361300, 28942, 9337, '<td valign="top">Those eyes are so innocent. The picture seems a bit grainy, I wish it was a little clearer.</td>', 'Those eyes are so innocent. The picture seems a bit grainy, I wish it was a little clearer.', '2003-07-19 20:58:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(361301, 29112, 9885, '<td valign="top">Nice work. Would even more blur be more effective?</td>', 'Nice work. Would even more blur be more effective?', '2003-07-19 20:58:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(361303, 29102, 9337, '<td valign="top">This is very neat. I like the special effect and would love to learn how to do that.</td>', 'This is very neat. I like the special effect and would love to learn how to do that.', '2003-07-19 21:00:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(361304, 29127, 7151, '<td valign="top">Better lighting would have actually communicated round.  As it is, it depends on me knowing what this is, and/or the title.  I do like the blurred effect of the ball in motion.  Might have been a better shot (as it is) for speed.</td>', 'Better lighting would have actually communicated round.  As it is, it depends on me knowing what this is, and/or the title.  I do like the blurred effect of the ball in motion.  Might have been a better shot (as it is) for speed.', '2003-07-19 21:00:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(361305, 28408, 9337, '<td valign="top">This is one of the best sunflower pics I''ve seen in the challenge. The colors in the center are fantastic!</td>', 'This is one of the best sunflower pics I''ve seen in the challenge. The colors in the center are fantastic!', '2003-07-19 21:01:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(361306, 28353, 9337, '<td valign="top">This picture seems out of focus and small.</td>', 'This picture seems out of focus and small.', '2003-07-19 21:02:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(361307, 29016, 9337, '<td valign="top">Very neat perspective.</td>', 'Very neat perspective.', '2003-07-19 21:02:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(361308, 28346, 7151, '<td valign="top">I''m curious how the title fits?  It doesn''t really convey "serene" to me.  But aside from that, good subject for the challenge, like the composition.  Lighting, choice of B&amp;W, focus are all good.  Nice job.</td>', 'I''m curious how the title fits?  It doesn''t really convey "serene" to me.  But aside from that, good subject for the challenge, like the composition.  Lighting, choice of B&W, focus are all good.  Nice job.', '2003-07-19 21:02:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(361310, 29176, 9337, '<td valign="top">Really neat picture. The colors are fantastic. My mind seems to want to see the plate angled back at the top for some reason.</td>', 'Really neat picture. The colors are fantastic. My mind seems to want to see the plate angled back at the top for some reason.', '2003-07-19 21:04:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(361311, 29051, 7151, '<td valign="top">This was a really good idea.  I think it could have been done a lot better by taking some time to get the straws a little neater.  Color feels a little faded, and its pretty soft.  And the slight over-exposure at the right is a little distracting to me.</td>', 'This was a really good idea.  I think it could have been done a lot better by taking some time to get the straws a little neater.  Color feels a little faded, and its pretty soft.  And the slight over-exposure at the right is a little distracting to me.', '2003-07-19 21:04:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(361312, 28410, 9337, '<td valign="top">Wow the colors in this picture are dramatic! How?</td>', 'Wow the colors in this picture are dramatic! How?', '2003-07-19 21:06:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(361313, 28709, 7151, '<td valign="top">Too bad you couldn''t get rid of whatever''s down to the right.  The jelly (I assume that''s a jelly fish?) looks quite cool.  Well captured.</td>', 'Too bad you couldn''t get rid of whatever''s down to the right.  The jelly (I assume that''s a jelly fish?) looks quite cool.  Well captured.', '2003-07-19 21:06:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(361314, 28943, 7151, '<td valign="top">Good effort, but the color''s a bit muted.  I''m assuming you were trying to keep reflections out of the glass.  The angle feels a little odd - it leaves a lot of background at the top that keeps drawing my attention away from the glasses.  A good idea that you might have been able to improve a little with some more work.</td>', 'Good effort, but the color''s a bit muted.  I''m assuming you were trying to keep reflections out of the glass.  The angle feels a little odd - it leaves a lot of background at the top that keeps drawing my attention away from the glasses.  A good idea that you might have been able to improve a little with some more work.', '2003-07-19 21:09:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(361315, 28069, 9337, '<td valign="top">Great capture of that halo</td>', 'Great capture of that halo', '2003-07-19 21:10:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(361316, 28401, 7151, '<td valign="top">Did you try a shot from straight under?  The angle doesn''t lend itself very well to a feeling of "round".  (I''m not saying it doesn''t meet the challenge, just that it might have done it better from a lower angle.)</td>', 'Did you try a shot from straight under?  The angle doesn''t lend itself very well to a feeling of "round".  (I''m not saying it doesn''t meet the challenge, just that it might have done it better from a lower angle.)', '2003-07-19 21:10:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(361317, 28596, 10392, '<td valign="top">Very nice!</td>', 'Very nice!', '2003-07-19 21:11:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(361318, 29135, 9337, '<td valign="top">Nice eye. Great colors, very sharp. How did you get so close without blocking the light?</td>', 'Nice eye. Great colors, very sharp. How did you get so close without blocking the light?', '2003-07-19 21:11:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(361319, 29168, 9337, '<td valign="top">This picture appears to be out of focus.</td>', 'This picture appears to be out of focus.', '2003-07-19 21:12:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(361320, 28384, 9337, '<td valign="top">I like the beam of light, the colors are great.</td>', 'I like the beam of light, the colors are great.', '2003-07-19 21:13:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(361321, 28391, 7151, '<td valign="top">What is it?  Ice cream on the floor?  It is round...  But the focus and lighting just make it too hard to make out what it is.  Or why it''s "good karma".</td>', 'What is it?  Ice cream on the floor?  It is round...  But the focus and lighting just make it too hard to make out what it is.  Or why it''s "good karma".', '2003-07-19 21:13:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(361322, 28364, 7151, '<td valign="top">The colors don''t say "lush" to me.  It''s also kind of dark, and not very sharp.  I guess the flowers are roundish, but don''t really convey roundness very well.</td>', 'The colors don''t say "lush" to me.  It''s also kind of dark, and not very sharp.  I guess the flowers are roundish, but don''t really convey roundness very well.', '2003-07-19 21:15:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(361323, 28130, 9337, '<td valign="top">Great use of shadow.</td>', 'Great use of shadow.', '2003-07-19 21:15:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(361324, 28867, 9337, '<td valign="top">Best spyder shot I''ve seen so far. The web detail and DOF is fantastic. I still hate spyders!</td>', 'Best spyder shot I''ve seen so far. The web detail and DOF is fantastic. I still hate spyders!', '2003-07-19 21:17:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(361325, 28358, 7151, '<td valign="top">Did your CCD survive?  I didn''t think you were supposed to do this with a digital camera...  What else can I say - Focus:  did it focus to infinity - then I guess it would have been in focus!  ;-)  Sorry, just havin'' some fun with you.  It''s an OK photo of the sun, as it were, but doesn''t really convey "round".  OK, the sun is round, but you can''t really see the sun.  The clouds are nice, but not really spectacular.  Just basically an OK shot.</td>', 'Did your CCD survive?  I didn''t think you were supposed to do this with a digital camera...  What else can I say - Focus:  did it focus to infinity - then I guess it would have been in focus!  ;-)  Sorry, just havin'' some fun with you.  It''s an OK photo of the sun, as it were, but doesn''t really convey "round".  OK, the sun is round, but you can''t really see the sun.  The clouds are nice, but not really spectacular.  Just basically an OK shot.', '2003-07-19 21:17:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(361326, 28186, 7151, '<td valign="top">Nice.  I like the sort of "layers" or levels of roundness - the dome, the arches, the balls, the crescents.  Good cropping and composition to draw that out.  Lighting is ok, probably better than most times of day - the shadows are there, but not too dominant.  Focus is good, sharpness could maybe be a little better, but it''s OK.  Overall a nice shot, one of my favorites so far in this challenge.</td>', 'Nice.  I like the sort of "layers" or levels of roundness - the dome, the arches, the balls, the crescents.  Good cropping and composition to draw that out.  Lighting is ok, probably better than most times of day - the shadows are there, but not too dominant.  Focus is good, sharpness could maybe be a little better, but it''s OK.  Overall a nice shot, one of my favorites so far in this challenge.', '2003-07-19 21:20:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(361327, 28747, 9337, '<td valign="top">Whoa very neat effect. It does look like a planet</td>', 'Whoa very neat effect. It does look like a planet', '2003-07-19 21:21:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(361328, 28944, 7151, '<td valign="top">Nice.  I like it.  Good subject that meets the challenge well.  DOF is good - clouds are blurred, but not so much as to be indistinct.  The focus seems about right.  I think the only thing I can think of that might have improved it is using a slight fill flash - I just don''t like the bottom of the wheel (the part we''re looking at) being as dark as it is.</td>', 'Nice.  I like it.  Good subject that meets the challenge well.  DOF is good - clouds are blurred, but not so much as to be indistinct.  The focus seems about right.  I think the only thing I can think of that might have improved it is using a slight fill flash - I just don''t like the bottom of the wheel (the part we''re looking at) being as dark as it is.', '2003-07-19 21:23:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(361329, 29112, 7151, '<td valign="top">I think more motion or less - this is just at an in between level where it just looks blurry.  But the rest of the shot is definitely very sharp and crisp.  I also think that just a little wider shot would have been a little better - it feels a little cramped as it is.  But a very nice shot overall.</td>', 'I think more motion or less - this is just at an in between level where it just looks blurry.  But the rest of the shot is definitely very sharp and crisp.  I also think that just a little wider shot would have been a little better - it feels a little cramped as it is.  But a very nice shot overall.', '2003-07-19 21:25:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(361330, 28096, 9337, '<td valign="top">Really neat reflection shot.</td>', 'Really neat reflection shot.', '2003-07-19 21:26:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(361331, 28924, 7151, '<td valign="top">A little too distant, I think, and not very clear at that.  I think you could have improved the result a little by cropping closer in to the wheel, and getting whatever that is in the lower right out of the picture.  Aside from removing that distraction, it would have made the wheel (the roundness) more prominant.</td>', 'A little too distant, I think, and not very clear at that.  I think you could have improved the result a little by cropping closer in to the wheel, and getting whatever that is in the lower right out of the picture.  Aside from removing that distraction, it would have made the wheel (the roundness) more prominant.', '2003-07-19 21:27:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(361332, 29057, 9337, '<td valign="top">The black and white feels like it detracts from this image. Hard to say without seeing the color I guess, but how it feels when I look at it.</td>', 'The black and white feels like it detracts from this image. Hard to say without seeing the color I guess, but how it feels when I look at it.', '2003-07-19 21:27:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(361333, 28940, 7151, '<td valign="top">...pixilated without a strong enought lens.  If you wanted to do the full moon, you should have waited until Sunday or Monday night, when it was actually full.</td>', '...pixilated without a strong enought lens.  If you wanted to do the full moon, you should have waited until Sunday or Monday night, when it was actually full.', '2003-07-19 21:28:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(361334, 29157, 7151, '<td valign="top">Hope nobody was blinded posing for this shot!  Good humorous entry.</td>', 'Hope nobody was blinded posing for this shot!  Good humorous entry.', '2003-07-19 21:31:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(361335, 28596, 7151, '<td valign="top">Nice.  No reflection of the photographer, that I can find - excellent!  All the technical issues look good, especially the DOF.  Great job.</td>', 'Nice.  No reflection of the photographer, that I can find - excellent!  All the technical issues look good, especially the DOF.  Great job.', '2003-07-19 21:33:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(361337, 28770, 7151, '<td valign="top">The tones are weird (for me) on this.  I\''m sure it\''s what you wanted, it\''s just not working for me.  I also think the yolk should definitely have been more in the focal range, and the edge of the paper towel being blurred keeps bugging me too.  But it\''s definitely a good and (so far) unique idea.  The composition is great except for whatever\''s going on in the upper right hand corner.  Just a couple elements short of being a great picture.</td>', 'The tones are weird (for me) on this.  I\''m sure it\''s what you wanted, it\''s just not working for me.  I also think the yolk should definitely have been more in the focal range, and the edge of the paper towel being blurred keeps bugging me too.  But it\''s definitely a good and (so far) unique idea.  The composition is great except for whatever\''s going on in the upper right hand corner.  Just a couple elements short of being a great picture.', '2003-07-19 21:38:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(361339, 28911, 7151, '<td valign="top">A good idea (and great title), but the composition could have been improved greatly by closing in on one or two of the bales, hopefully getting the tractor and maybe the phone poles, if not out of the picture, then at least out of the middle area.  Color is good, especially for it being overcast, focus and sharpness are good.  Just wish some of the "marshmallows" took over the shot a little.</td>', 'A good idea (and great title), but the composition could have been improved greatly by closing in on one or two of the bales, hopefully getting the tractor and maybe the phone poles, if not out of the picture, then at least out of the middle area.  Color is good, especially for it being overcast, focus and sharpness are good.  Just wish some of the "marshmallows" took over the shot a little.', '2003-07-19 21:41:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(361342, 29103, 7151, '<td valign="top">Good subject for the challenge - round within round, within round.  Focus is good, B&amp;W works ok.  Two things I don''t like:  The crop is too tight - I get that you were trying to focus in on the main circle, but you got so tight that the surrounding elements - the edge of the bigger arch, the two little arches below - sort of infringe on the shot.  Opening out a little would have, IMO, allowed them to be more in context and improved the overall feel.  Also (and I realize that you might not have had much choice), but the shadow really detracts.  If you could have shot it at a different time, it might have helped that.  But a good shot overall.</td>', 'Good subject for the challenge - round within round, within round.  Focus is good, B&W works ok.  Two things I don''t like:  The crop is too tight - I get that you were trying to focus in on the main circle, but you got so tight that the surrounding elements - the edge of the bigger arch, the two little arches below - sort of infringe on the shot.  Opening out a little would have, IMO, allowed them to be more in context and improved the overall feel.  Also (and I realize that you might not have had much choice), but the shadow really detracts.  If you could have shot it at a different time, it might have helped that.  But a good shot overall.', '2003-07-19 21:46:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(361349, 29099, 4049, '<td valign="top">I dont like the flash mark and reflection</td>', 'I dont like the flash mark and reflection', '2003-07-19 21:59:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(361351, 28925, 4049, '<td valign="top">Red 12!!!</td>', 'Red 12!!!', '2003-07-19 22:00:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(361353, 29091, 7151, '<td valign="top">An odd mix of objects, but it does make for an interesting image.</td>', 'An odd mix of objects, but it does make for an interesting image.', '2003-07-19 22:03:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(361354, 29142, 4049, '<td valign="top">Interesting</td>', 'Interesting', '2003-07-19 22:04:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(361363, 28453, 9885, '<td valign="top">Good subject - image is a bit ''flat" - more interesting lighting would help a lot</td>', 'Good subject - image is a bit ''flat" - more interesting lighting would help a lot', '2003-07-19 22:54:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(361365, 28788, 9885, '<td valign="top">sorry, can''t really see the connection with "round"</td>', 'sorry, can''t really see the connection with "round"', '2003-07-19 22:57:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(361367, 28611, 472, '<td valign="top">interesting.  this shot is like the closeup cousin of another shot i''ve seen on dpc .. one i liked alot!</td>', 'interesting.  this shot is like the closeup cousin of another shot i''ve seen on dpc .. one i liked alot!', '2003-07-19 23:00:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(361368, 28867, 9885, '<td valign="top">a shame the web isn''t highlighted a bit more.</td>', 'a shame the web isn''t highlighted a bit more.', '2003-07-19 23:04:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(361371, 28552, 9885, '<td valign="top">I''d like the top third cropped - it''s a bit distracting. Otherwise, good shot.</td>', 'I''d like the top third cropped - it''s a bit distracting. Otherwise, good shot.', '2003-07-19 23:10:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(361372, 28537, 772, '<td valign="top">I have been waiting several days to post a comment on this photo... It''s my favorite photo of the challenge and I can''t really put my finger on WHY.  I believe it''s in the simplicity of the image.  The monochromatic theme... the square frame with the abstract distortion in the mirror.  All I can say is ''excellent work'' :) = 10</td>', 'I have been waiting several days to post a comment on this photo... It''s my favorite photo of the challenge and I can''t really put my finger on WHY.  I believe it''s in the simplicity of the image.  The monochromatic theme... the square frame with the abstract distortion in the mirror.  All I can say is ''excellent work'' :) = 10', '2003-07-19 23:11:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(361377, 28672, 9885, '<td valign="top">wonderful shot - colour, detail, sharpness. well done</td>', 'wonderful shot - colour, detail, sharpness. well done', '2003-07-19 23:16:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(361380, 28997, 8637, '<td valign="top">Very nice photo...great colors, very well formatted and cropped. Origina idea.  Thanks!</td>', 'Very nice photo...great colors, very well formatted and cropped. Origina idea.  Thanks!', '2003-07-19 23:21:38.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(361381, 29109, 8637, '<td valign="top">Neat capture and original approach for the challenge.  Thanks</td>', 'Neat capture and original approach for the challenge.  Thanks', '2003-07-19 23:22:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(361382, 28867, 8637, '<td valign="top">Great macro and the title says it all.  Very nice capture...little DOF loss on the web but understandable.  thanks</td>', 'Great macro and the title says it all.  Very nice capture...little DOF loss on the web but understandable.  thanks', '2003-07-19 23:23:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(361383, 28760, 8637, '<td valign="top">The lighting is excellent here...beautiful work and very original idea.  Thanks</td>', 'The lighting is excellent here...beautiful work and very original idea.  Thanks', '2003-07-19 23:25:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(361384, 28798, 8637, '<td valign="top">Crisp shot and beautiful color.  thanks</td>', 'Crisp shot and beautiful color.  thanks', '2003-07-19 23:27:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(361385, 28551, 8637, '<td valign="top">I really like this one...little less bightness on the sun would help...but neat idea.  thanks</td>', 'I really like this one...little less bightness on the sun would help...but neat idea.  thanks', '2003-07-19 23:28:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(361386, 28537, 8637, '<td valign="top">Very unusual and artistic work.  Interesting idea and excellent set up.  thanks</td>', 'Very unusual and artistic work.  Interesting idea and excellent set up.  thanks', '2003-07-19 23:29:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(361387, 28888, 9885, '<td valign="top">I think the object of the photo (ie the rock) should be more prominent, ie crop ruthlessly!</td>', 'I think the object of the photo (ie the rock) should be more prominent, ie crop ruthlessly!', '2003-07-19 23:44:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(361388, 29132, 9885, '<td valign="top">good idea - image should have been cleaned up to remove the spots</td>', 'good idea - image should have been cleaned up to remove the spots', '2003-07-19 23:50:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(361393, 29072, 9885, '<td valign="top">would improve with sharper focussing.</td>', 'would improve with sharper focussing.', '2003-07-19 23:56:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(361397, 29019, 10412, '<td valign="top">This already won the STF challenge!</td>', 'This already won the STF challenge!', '2003-07-20 00:04:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(361403, 28875, 8953, '<td valign="top">I like the concept of this shot. I think it would have done better centered in the black or cropped tighter. the focus is super and the light balnce was don well.</td>', 'I like the concept of this shot. I think it would have done better centered in the black or cropped tighter. the focus is super and the light balnce was don well.', '2003-07-20 00:34:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(361405, 28797, 8953, '<td valign="top">given the nature of your shot with the tea cup in the center this would have worked well to have cropped so that the tea cups at top would have been the same at the bottom. taking the shot from directly above would have also helped the overall appeal. on the other side i do like the concept of your shot</td>', 'given the nature of your shot with the tea cup in the center this would have worked well to have cropped so that the tea cups at top would have been the same at the bottom. taking the shot from directly above would have also helped the overall appeal. on the other side i do like the concept of your shot', '2003-07-20 00:39:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(361406, 28224, 8953, '<td valign="top">clever shot! the light comming in from one side and the DOF make this work for me. waht also works for me is it is not just another screw. lots of color...rust? good job coming up with round! I bet alot of people will miss the fact and only get the point:)8</td>', 'clever shot! the light comming in from one side and the DOF make this work for me. waht also works for me is it is not just another screw. lots of color...rust? good job coming up with round! I bet alot of people will miss the fact and only get the point:)8', '2003-07-20 00:42:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(361407, 28959, 8953, '<td valign="top">great idea! cropping is a little tight to the left for my taste and the shadows in the rings are a bit distracting...maybe one ring just laying over the other? good focus</td>', 'great idea! cropping is a little tight to the left for my taste and the shadows in the rings are a bit distracting...maybe one ring just laying over the other? good focus', '2003-07-20 00:47:16.000000', NULL, 1),
