(362348, 28785, 9582, '<td valign="top">Wow! This sculpture is now on display in New Smyrna Beach, Florida (the city that I live in).  I love this artist''s work, and I like your photo of it very much. I have taken many photos of these sculptures and I thought of entering one in this challenge, but my background was distracting. I like the background in your photo. It works nicely.</td>', 'Wow! This sculpture is now on display in New Smyrna Beach, Florida (the city that I live in).  I love this artist''s work, and I like your photo of it very much. I have taken many photos of these sculptures and I thought of entering one in this challenge, but my background was distracting. I like the background in your photo. It works nicely.', '2003-07-21 12:12:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(362352, 29114, 9504, '<td valign="top">Too dark..I feel like I want to turn the lights on a bit more.  I feel eye strain...</td>', 'Too dark..I feel like I want to turn the lights on a bit more.  I feel eye strain...', '2003-07-21 12:13:41.000000', NULL, 1),
