(362361, 28420, 4514, '<td valign="top">The lighting in the background is very harsh but it does seem to set a mood.</td>', 'The lighting in the background is very harsh but it does seem to set a mood.', '2003-07-21 12:18:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(362363, 28600, 4514, '<td valign="top">Well I will say that this gives the feeling of Rounded.  Very nice on the Color.  Light is a bit harsh but we know how hard it is to light an Egg.  <br/></td>', 'Well I will say that this gives the feeling of Rounded.  Very nice on the Color.  Light is a bit harsh but we know how hard it is to light an Egg.  ', '2003-07-21 12:18:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(362366, 29175, 4514, '<td valign="top">Hay!!!!!   :-)<br/>Pull out just a bit and get the whole roll off center and you have a really strong shot.</td>', 'Hay!!!!!   :-)Pull out just a bit and get the whole roll off center and you have a really strong shot.', '2003-07-21 12:20:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(362418, 29126, 9337, '<td valign="top">The clouds in the background are very dramatic. This shot is very appealing, and patriotic. The only problem I have is that the building is tilted too far to the right in relation to your border.</td>', 'The clouds in the background are very dramatic. This shot is very appealing, and patriotic. The only problem I have is that the building is tilted too far to the right in relation to your border.', '2003-07-21 12:56:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(362455, 29077, 5822, '<td valign="top">I like the composition very much and think it''s a great idea for this challenge.  Technically, I find the focus a bit too soft and wish you had been able to bring out the luster and shine out a bit more in the silver and gold pieces. Maybe a good cleaner would have done it.  In addition, I wish the background detail and lighting would have been better.  I would like to see some more of it''s color. It appears to be a dark blue, but I can''t tell for certain.</td>', 'I like the composition very much and think it''s a great idea for this challenge.  Technically, I find the focus a bit too soft and wish you had been able to bring out the luster and shine out a bit more in the silver and gold pieces. Maybe a good cleaner would have done it.  In addition, I wish the background detail and lighting would have been better.  I would like to see some more of it''s color. It appears to be a dark blue, but I can''t tell for certain.', '2003-07-21 13:35:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(362461, 29156, 5822, '<td valign="top">I like this image and the colors of the marbles. I just wish the DOF was more deep so that all the marbles would be in focus and also find the bag/cloth on the left hand side serves no purpose in the image and distracts.  The colored marbles contrasts nicely with the texture and grey color of the sand.</td>', 'I like this image and the colors of the marbles. I just wish the DOF was more deep so that all the marbles would be in focus and also find the bag/cloth on the left hand side serves no purpose in the image and distracts.  The colored marbles contrasts nicely with the texture and grey color of the sand.', '2003-07-21 13:38:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(362472, 29149, 5822, '<td valign="top">You''ve taken a very simple subject and made it into a work of art!  Though I think the image could use some thing more of interest in it, such as a baseball glove or cap, I like the close up and detail you''ve been able to capture and also like the DOF and the color of the background goes very well with the ball. Nice job.</td>', 'You''ve taken a very simple subject and made it into a work of art!  Though I think the image could use some thing more of interest in it, such as a baseball glove or cap, I like the close up and detail you''ve been able to capture and also like the DOF and the color of the background goes very well with the ball. Nice job.', '2003-07-21 13:55:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(362474, 28834, 2130, '<td valign="top">I would have liked to see the rest of his leg, otherwise a really strong and beautiful photo</td>', 'I would have liked to see the rest of his leg, otherwise a really strong and beautiful photo', '2003-07-21 13:58:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(362499, 29066, 5822, '<td valign="top">I like the composition very much and the contrasting geometric shapes and colors. I wish, however, that you had uses softer lighting as the shadows that are cast confuse the foreground.  Also, I don''t think it necessary to use such a narrow DOF as I''d like to see all the squares in focus.</td>', 'I like the composition very much and the contrasting geometric shapes and colors. I wish, however, that you had uses softer lighting as the shadows that are cast confuse the foreground.  Also, I don''t think it necessary to use such a narrow DOF as I''d like to see all the squares in focus.', '2003-07-21 14:26:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(362502, 29149, 157, '<td valign="top">a classic...you captured it very well. my only 10 for this challenge. :)</td>', 'a classic...you captured it very well. my only 10 for this challenge. :)', '2003-07-21 14:29:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(362506, 29106, 5822, '<td valign="top">Although this meets challenge theme, lack of visual interest  and/or artisitic value will limit it''s score.  In addition, I find the exposure to be off as it appears the subject to be underexposed and the background to be overexposed.</td>', 'Although this meets challenge theme, lack of visual interest  and/or artisitic value will limit it''s score.  In addition, I find the exposure to be off as it appears the subject to be underexposed and the background to be overexposed.', '2003-07-21 14:37:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(362512, 28519, 5822, '<td valign="top">I like the viewpoint of this photo and the way you''ve fit in both wheels into the  frame.  However, I find that underexposure of the car has obscured detail...there is just too much negative space.  I think had you exposed properly, your choice of B&amp;W would be perfect.  Unrealized potential.</td>', 'I like the viewpoint of this photo and the way you''ve fit in both wheels into the  frame.  However, I find that underexposure of the car has obscured detail...there is just too much negative space.  I think had you exposed properly, your choice of B&W would be perfect.  Unrealized potential.', '2003-07-21 14:42:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(362513, 28788, 5822, '<td valign="top">Two round heads...very good interpretation of the challenge theme.  Your focus is right on and I love the DOF so that both fore, and backrounds are blurred.  You really isolated your subject.   Also,  you''ve really captured an excellent expression on this kid''s face.  Very well done.</td>', 'Two round heads...very good interpretation of the challenge theme.  Your focus is right on and I love the DOF so that both fore, and backrounds are blurred.  You really isolated your subject.   Also,  you''ve really captured an excellent expression on this kid''s face.  Very well done.', '2003-07-21 14:45:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(362517, 28785, 5982, '<td valign="top">Would the people have been located in the middle of the structure that picture would have been a great one.  Nice though!</td>', 'Would the people have been located in the middle of the structure that picture would have been a great one.  Nice though!', '2003-07-21 14:52:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(362520, 29013, 5822, '<td valign="top">I"m going to be very blunt about this photo...It''s just plain good! Very good, as a matter of fact.  Your focus is right on and I like the duotones as well.  Could use a little more contrast, but still a good shot nonetheless.  I also really like the contrasting curves and lines and the viewpoint you have taken is very interesting. You can'' t really tell if you are looking down or up at the subject.   Very good abstract...keep up the good work!</td>', 'I"m going to be very blunt about this photo...It''s just plain good! Very good, as a matter of fact.  Your focus is right on and I like the duotones as well.  Could use a little more contrast, but still a good shot nonetheless.  I also really like the contrasting curves and lines and the viewpoint you have taken is very interesting. You can'' t really tell if you are looking down or up at the subject.   Very good abstract...keep up the good work!', '2003-07-21 14:54:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(362524, 28784, 5822, '<td valign="top">I really don''t find that this photo meets the challenge theme despite you putting it in a round border, and that''s too bad cause this image is just wonderful.  I love the colors and the DOF is very good.</td>', 'I really don''t find that this photo meets the challenge theme despite you putting it in a round border, and that''s too bad cause this image is just wonderful.  I love the colors and the DOF is very good.', '2003-07-21 14:59:16.000000', NULL, 1),
