(362607, 28390, 7711, '<td valign="top">I like this composition, but the lighting seems harsh as it has left many distracting and disparate reflections and the shadows created by the bigger marbles are also a problem. As well, seems as if a greater DOF or better focus is required as the whole shot seems out of focus somewhat.</td>', 'I like this composition, but the lighting seems harsh as it has left many distracting and disparate reflections and the shadows created by the bigger marbles are also a problem. As well, seems as if a greater DOF or better focus is required as the whole shot seems out of focus somewhat.', '2003-07-21 17:05:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(362609, 28879, 7711, '<td valign="top">fun angle, and I adore your lighting, its so warm and moody. Textures captured on the rope and the overall focus is great as well! 9</td>', 'fun angle, and I adore your lighting, its so warm and moody. Textures captured on the rope and the overall focus is great as well! 9', '2003-07-21 17:06:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(362610, 29127, 7711, '<td valign="top">nice shot! A little more light on the strings would help distinguish what this is (took me a minute to figure out what I was looking at).</td>', 'nice shot! A little more light on the strings would help distinguish what this is (took me a minute to figure out what I was looking at).', '2003-07-21 17:07:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(362613, 28130, 7711, '<td valign="top">very neat! At first I was trying to figure out if this arrangement meant anything, or was in some special code, but then I gave up my aspirations of John Nash and just admired the use of light and shadow to create a feeling of round times two!</td>', 'very neat! At first I was trying to figure out if this arrangement meant anything, or was in some special code, but then I gave up my aspirations of John Nash and just admired the use of light and shadow to create a feeling of round times two!', '2003-07-21 17:10:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(362621, 29192, 7711, '<td valign="top">I see you''ve kept this (or made it) grainy, which I can appreciate, but I think I might have preferred this a little less noisy because the balls are so smooth and might look better if the shot of them was equally slick and smooth. Lighting is intriguing as well. I like creation of shadows to emphasize the roundness. (would have liked a little more light in the back too though..seems too dark there)</td>', 'I see you''ve kept this (or made it) grainy, which I can appreciate, but I think I might have preferred this a little less noisy because the balls are so smooth and might look better if the shot of them was equally slick and smooth. Lighting is intriguing as well. I like creation of shadows to emphasize the roundness. (would have liked a little more light in the back too though..seems too dark there)', '2003-07-21 17:14:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(362623, 28420, 7711, '<td valign="top">Unique framing! The roundness is all in the framing of the lighthouse, but the curves of the trees remind us what the theme of the photo is as well. What a great find and nice shot.</td>', 'Unique framing! The roundness is all in the framing of the lighthouse, but the curves of the trees remind us what the theme of the photo is as well. What a great find and nice shot.', '2003-07-21 17:15:58.000000', NULL, 1),
