(362803, 29146, 8860, '<td valign="top">Looks like you need to improve your aim or cover the pond! Nice crisp image but it could have been more interesting with a lower angle so that the balls overlapped each other (smallest then steadily larger). The reeds would have become more involved too and the viewer would have been quite challenged with what they were looking at - particularly if there were some reflections.</td>', 'Looks like you need to improve your aim or cover the pond! Nice crisp image but it could have been more interesting with a lower angle so that the balls overlapped each other (smallest then steadily larger). The reeds would have become more involved too and the viewer would have been quite challenged with what they were looking at - particularly if there were some reflections.', '2003-07-21 20:26:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(362809, 28875, 8860, '<td valign="top">Nice point of view. I wonder if this would look better centred and filling the frame more since the interest is in the shape and texture? Less context would aid the artistic nature of the image.</td>', 'Nice point of view. I wonder if this would look better centred and filling the frame more since the interest is in the shape and texture? Less context would aid the artistic nature of the image.', '2003-07-21 20:30:02.000000', NULL, 1),
