(363302, 28902, 8891, '<td valign="top">like all the interesting round shapes...I find it a bit busy, some of the stones are not interesting and none of them are as interesting as the center object  which while being round also has a lot of round designs going on its own and would have fine just by itself. Also I think a different color background, something more neutral or background....tons of promise here.</td>', 'like all the interesting round shapes...I find it a bit busy, some of the stones are not interesting and none of them are as interesting as the center object  which while being round also has a lot of round designs going on its own and would have fine just by itself. Also I think a different color background, something more neutral or background....tons of promise here.', '2003-07-22 09:30:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(363307, 29091, 8891, '<td valign="top">The science of lighting a still life like this escapes me, I know that it can be done, I just don''t know how so if someone tells you, by all means let me know. Like the reflections amongst the objects.</td>', 'The science of lighting a still life like this escapes me, I know that it can be done, I just don''t know how so if someone tells you, by all means let me know. Like the reflections amongst the objects.', '2003-07-22 09:33:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(363308, 28547, 8891, '<td valign="top">hmmmm donuts....thanks homer.....i think perhaps the plate too big....also the lighting here is quite fine and just the plate on the nicely colored BG would have made a nice shot as well.</td>', 'hmmmm donuts....thanks homer.....i think perhaps the plate too big....also the lighting here is quite fine and just the plate on the nicely colored BG would have made a nice shot as well.', '2003-07-22 09:36:43.000000', NULL, 1),
