(363864, 28881, 4338, '<td valign="top">good concept, but I would have use a slightly lower angle and gotten closer to the subject and used and different back ground and some different cropping would have worked.</td>', 'good concept, but I would have use a slightly lower angle and gotten closer to the subject and used and different back ground and some different cropping would have worked.', '2003-07-22 21:22:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(363865, 28834, 1031, '<td valign="top">Don''t think you needed the "round" reference in your title. Alternatively, you might call it "Seen Too Many Rounds" or "One Round Too Many" to sneak in multiple meanings in the context of having a person there ...<br/>In any event, a sad but creative take on the challenge!</td>', 'Don''t think you needed the "round" reference in your title. Alternatively, you might call it "Seen Too Many Rounds" or "One Round Too Many" to sneak in multiple meanings in the context of having a person there ...In any event, a sad but creative take on the challenge!', '2003-07-22 21:24:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(363866, 28264, 1031, '<td valign="top">Some variety of Boletus? Impressive composition, focus, and exposure considering the "setup." As I remember you''re in competition with some worms/larvae which seem to be already resident in the mushroom even as it sprouts.</td>', 'Some variety of Boletus? Impressive composition, focus, and exposure considering the "setup." As I remember you''re in competition with some worms/larvae which seem to be already resident in the mushroom even as it sprouts.', '2003-07-22 21:31:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(363867, 28536, 1031, '<td valign="top">Nice job using available equipment; exposure/tone range especially looks good.</td>', 'Nice job using available equipment; exposure/tone range especially looks good.', '2003-07-22 21:34:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(363870, 28614, 1031, '<td valign="top">Nice exposure/tone range. Shot from Southern Hemisphere?</td>', 'Nice exposure/tone range. Shot from Southern Hemisphere?', '2003-07-22 21:37:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(363871, 29183, 1031, '<td valign="top">I don''t know about your photo but I''m definitely stealing your recipe!</td>', 'I don''t know about your photo but I''m definitely stealing your recipe!', '2003-07-22 21:40:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(363872, 28376, 1031, '<td valign="top">I think the soft look is OK here, but I''m not crazy about the coloring.</td>', 'I think the soft look is OK here, but I''m not crazy about the coloring.', '2003-07-22 21:41:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(363874, 28836, 1031, '<td valign="top">At least you refrained from titling it "Make My Day." Nice detail and exposure.</td>', 'At least you refrained from titling it "Make My Day." Nice detail and exposure.', '2003-07-22 21:44:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(363877, 29019, 1031, '<td valign="top">Looks like a pretty effective motion blur. I don''t think my camera can quite do this.</td>', 'Looks like a pretty effective motion blur. I don''t think my camera can quite do this.', '2003-07-22 21:53:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(363878, 28401, 1031, '<td valign="top">Do those globes double as security mirrors?</td>', 'Do those globes double as security mirrors?', '2003-07-22 21:54:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(363879, 29134, 1031, '<td valign="top">Looks like a good way to get soot on the lens or singe your eyebrows!</td>', 'Looks like a good way to get soot on the lens or singe your eyebrows!', '2003-07-22 21:55:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(363882, 29168, 5266, '<td valign="top">A neat idea, but the focus is just too soft on the photo.</td>', 'A neat idea, but the focus is just too soft on the photo.', '2003-07-22 22:00:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(363883, 28871, 5266, '<td valign="top">WOW!!!!  Incredible photo - I''m not crazy about the Photoshop-py effects you have used, but the overall idea is a killer!!  9</td>', 'WOW!!!!  Incredible photo - I''m not crazy about the Photoshop-py effects you have used, but the overall idea is a killer!!  9', '2003-07-22 22:01:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(363884, 28703, 8597, '<td valign="top">I like the composition, but your exposure seems a bit washed out...</td>', 'I like the composition, but your exposure seems a bit washed out...', '2003-07-22 22:08:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(363886, 29179, 5266, '<td valign="top">GIANT MARSHMALLOWS!!!!!  LOL - I know what it really is, but it''s a joke with my friends!!  Beautiful scenery!!  Love your interpretation of Round!!</td>', 'GIANT MARSHMALLOWS!!!!!  LOL - I know what it really is, but it''s a joke with my friends!!  Beautiful scenery!!  Love your interpretation of Round!!', '2003-07-22 22:11:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(363887, 28325, 1031, '<td valign="top">"Time" for a new stereo system!</td>', '"Time" for a new stereo system!', '2003-07-22 22:13:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(363893, 29109, 8597, '<td valign="top">Great composition; interesting interpretation of the theme; though a bit over-exposed.</td>', 'Great composition; interesting interpretation of the theme; though a bit over-exposed.', '2003-07-22 22:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(363896, 29066, 1031, '<td valign="top">It''s a good sign that <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=2721" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Isaac</a> was able to name your subject without reading the title! Very funny!</td>', 'It''s a good sign that Isaac was able to name your subject without reading the title! Very funny!', '2003-07-22 22:22:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(363902, 28463, 5266, '<td valign="top">AWESOME DOF!!!!  The detail of the water drops on the grass is wonderful.  WOW!!!</td>', 'AWESOME DOF!!!!  The detail of the water drops on the grass is wonderful.  WOW!!!', '2003-07-22 22:29:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(363904, 29177, 8597, '<td valign="top">This image is quite beautiful.  A true 10.  I would love to know about the exposure....</td>', 'This image is quite beautiful.  A true 10.  I would love to know about the exposure....', '2003-07-22 22:33:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(363905, 28911, 5266, '<td valign="top">Giant marshmallows - they are processed into the tiny ones.  Have you ever seen the unbleached kind?  They''re sort of beige in color!!  LOL!!!  Love your interpretation and the colors of the grass and sky.  Nice job.</td>', 'Giant marshmallows - they are processed into the tiny ones.  Have you ever seen the unbleached kind?  They''re sort of beige in color!!  LOL!!!  Love your interpretation and the colors of the grass and sky.  Nice job.', '2003-07-22 22:33:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(363907, 29096, 2152, '<td valign="top">Come on, I''ve seen some blurry pics on this site, but this takes the cake.  Ever hear of a tripod?!?!<br/> <br/>Just kidding - this is one of my favorites this week.  Composition is excellent and the movement of the camera is steady.  It makes for a unique, well-executed shot.</td>', 'Come on, I''ve seen some blurry pics on this site, but this takes the cake.  Ever hear of a tripod?!?! Just kidding - this is one of my favorites this week.  Composition is excellent and the movement of the camera is steady.  It makes for a unique, well-executed shot.', '2003-07-22 22:35:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(363908, 29149, 8597, '<td valign="top">Great lighting, capture of detail, and composition!</td>', 'Great lighting, capture of detail, and composition!', '2003-07-22 22:36:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(363909, 29016, 2152, '<td valign="top">I like the complexity in this shot.  But it looks a little underexposed.  I think some more contrast would help the subject stand out a little more.  I''m not a fan of the border.</td>', 'I like the complexity in this shot.  But it looks a little underexposed.  I think some more contrast would help the subject stand out a little more.  I''m not a fan of the border.', '2003-07-22 22:38:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(363910, 28130, 2152, '<td valign="top">Certainly one of the more intersting shots this week.  I really like the color gradient of the background between the top and bottom.  I think a shot like this does need some sort of border, but this particular border seems to take it a bit too far.</td>', 'Certainly one of the more intersting shots this week.  I really like the color gradient of the background between the top and bottom.  I think a shot like this does need some sort of border, but this particular border seems to take it a bit too far.', '2003-07-22 22:40:27.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(363912, 28420, 2152, '<td valign="top">Tough exposure here, and the DPC rules really limit what you can do about it.  Composition is excellent although the sun brings my eye away from the lighthouse.</td>', 'Tough exposure here, and the DPC rules really limit what you can do about it.  Composition is excellent although the sun brings my eye away from the lighthouse.', '2003-07-22 22:44:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(363913, 28902, 8597, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and lighting, but a bit blurry.</td>', 'Nice composition and lighting, but a bit blurry.', '2003-07-22 22:45:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(363914, 28611, 8159, '<td valign="top">If only you went to the 8000 block! I like this shot, and the title.</td>', 'If only you went to the 8000 block! I like this shot, and the title.', '2003-07-22 22:46:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(363915, 28879, 2152, '<td valign="top">Good job with the dof - I like how the light is concentrated on the in-focus area.  Tones are good, too.  Not the most breathtaking subject, however.</td>', 'Good job with the dof - I like how the light is concentrated on the in-focus area.  Tones are good, too.  Not the most breathtaking subject, however.', '2003-07-22 22:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(363917, 28519, 2152, '<td valign="top">I like the high contrast.  Composition is pretty good, too.  But focus seems a little off on the front tire.</td>', 'I like the high contrast.  Composition is pretty good, too.  But focus seems a little off on the front tire.', '2003-07-22 22:49:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(363918, 28843, 8597, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, but the lighting seems too harsh and creates too much shadow.  Also, your subject''s skin appears over-exposed.</td>', 'Nice composition, but the lighting seems too harsh and creates too much shadow.  Also, your subject''s skin appears over-exposed.', '2003-07-22 22:50:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(363919, 29135, 8597, '<td valign="top">Great closeup details, but too bad for the reflection...</td>', 'Great closeup details, but too bad for the reflection...', '2003-07-22 22:55:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(363920, 28130, 8597, '<td valign="top">Really great composition &amp; lighting.</td>', 'Really great composition & lighting.', '2003-07-22 22:55:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(363921, 28834, 2152, '<td valign="top">Good idea and composition is good.  You certainly needed something other than just the plain wall for this shot, but I''m not sure a person was the best choice.  Or maybe it''s just the pose... yeah, I don''t think this particular pose works.  Not sure what I would suggest - maybe something a little less direct to the camera.  With that pose I''m not really sure what the subject is, the holes or the guy.</td>', 'Good idea and composition is good.  You certainly needed something other than just the plain wall for this shot, but I''m not sure a person was the best choice.  Or maybe it''s just the pose... yeah, I don''t think this particular pose works.  Not sure what I would suggest - maybe something a little less direct to the camera.  With that pose I''m not really sure what the subject is, the holes or the guy.', '2003-07-22 22:56:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(363922, 28551, 8597, '<td valign="top">Very creative composition!</td>', 'Very creative composition!', '2003-07-22 22:57:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(363923, 29189, 2152, '<td valign="top">Nice job with the lighting.  You did a good job of avoiding glare from the coins.</td>', 'Nice job with the lighting.  You did a good job of avoiding glare from the coins.', '2003-07-22 22:58:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(363924, 28410, 2152, '<td valign="top">Composition is excellent, however I think the [insert whatever plant that is here] in the middle of the frame should be in focus.</td>', 'Composition is excellent, however I think the [insert whatever plant that is here] in the middle of the frame should be in focus.', '2003-07-22 23:00:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(363926, 28943, 2152, '<td valign="top">I think a little more contrast might help the subject stand out a little more.  Interesting composition, but the image seems flat.  I can see what you''re going for with the background, but I think it''s a little busy.</td>', 'I think a little more contrast might help the subject stand out a little more.  Interesting composition, but the image seems flat.  I can see what you''re going for with the background, but I think it''s a little busy.', '2003-07-22 23:03:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(363927, 28393, 6938, '<td valign="top">Perhaps a different angle would have shown the roundness of the lip more.  I also think that a different background colour would have highlighted the plant more....  a more natural colour perhaps - green or blue.</td>', 'Perhaps a different angle would have shown the roundness of the lip more.  I also think that a different background colour would have highlighted the plant more....  a more natural colour perhaps - green or blue.', '2003-07-22 23:04:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(363928, 29093, 2152, '<td valign="top">Composition is nice, but the background takes my attention from the kid.  I like how the shadow extends diagonally toward the end of the frame.  Good choice with the black and white.</td>', 'Composition is nice, but the background takes my attention from the kid.  I like how the shadow extends diagonally toward the end of the frame.  Good choice with the black and white.', '2003-07-22 23:05:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(363930, 29019, 9913, '<td valign="top">a man cant even see what this is?....<br/>sorry but you get a 3 from me mister<br/></td>', 'a man cant even see what this is?....sorry but you get a 3 from me mister', '2003-07-22 23:06:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(363932, 28913, 2152, '<td valign="top">The lack of color here makes this shot a good candidate for black and white.  That would also help increase the contrast and put more emphasis on the round shapes, which are nice.  Composition is good.</td>', 'The lack of color here makes this shot a good candidate for black and white.  That would also help increase the contrast and put more emphasis on the round shapes, which are nice.  Composition is good.', '2003-07-22 23:08:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(363934, 28455, 9913, '<td valign="top">very nice pic but I would have like to have seen it lessed croped ..</td>', 'very nice pic but I would have like to have seen it lessed croped ..', '2003-07-22 23:10:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(363935, 29171, 2152, '<td valign="top">The lighting and tones here are great.  The subject really stands out.  Composition is good and I especially like the texture added by the bubbles.</td>', 'The lighting and tones here are great.  The subject really stands out.  Composition is good and I especially like the texture added by the bubbles.', '2003-07-22 23:12:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(363937, 28867, 6938, '<td valign="top">Perhaps some dew on the web would have highlighted the ''rings'' you are refering to.<br/></td>', 'Perhaps some dew on the web would have highlighted the ''rings'' you are refering to.', '2003-07-22 23:13:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(363938, 29127, 2152, '<td valign="top">I think if this was sharp and had some more light (especially on the wires and bottom of the balls) it would be great.  I like the composition and movement.  You had a good idea, but I don''t think it was executed as well as it could have been.</td>', 'I think if this was sharp and had some more light (especially on the wires and bottom of the balls) it would be great.  I like the composition and movement.  You had a good idea, but I don''t think it was executed as well as it could have been.', '2003-07-22 23:15:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(363941, 29107, 2152, '<td valign="top">I''m not really sure if I like the lighting because it emphasizes the sky more than the church.  I think the composition could be better, too.  I would suggest more of an angle or shoot it straight on to show the symmetry.  There are some shots where forcing the rule of thirds doesn''t work.</td>', 'I''m not really sure if I like the lighting because it emphasizes the sky more than the church.  I think the composition could be better, too.  I would suggest more of an angle or shoot it straight on to show the symmetry.  There are some shots where forcing the rule of thirds doesn''t work.', '2003-07-22 23:19:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(363948, 28356, 2152, '<td valign="top">I like the symmetry with the reflection, and the color is good too.  But the crop is a little tight for my taste - especially for a shot like this.</td>', 'I like the symmetry with the reflection, and the color is good too.  But the crop is a little tight for my taste - especially for a shot like this.', '2003-07-22 23:27:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(363949, 28567, 10499, '<td valign="top">love the shadows</td>', 'love the shadows', '2003-07-22 23:28:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(363951, 28868, 2152, '<td valign="top">Ya gotta love guns!  Ain''t nothing better for shootin'' stuff!  The two cartriges alone don''t offer much interest.  I would suggest more dramatic lighting, more of an angle and possibly part of a shotgun in the background</td>', 'Ya gotta love guns!  Ain''t nothing better for shootin'' stuff!  The two cartriges alone don''t offer much interest.  I would suggest more dramatic lighting, more of an angle and possibly part of a shotgun in the background', '2003-07-22 23:29:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(363952, 28871, 6771, '<td valign="top">I really like the harsh lighting to this one.  Interesting choice to colorize it.  I like this one</td>', 'I really like the harsh lighting to this one.  Interesting choice to colorize it.  I like this one', '2003-07-22 23:30:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(363955, 29014, 2152, '<td valign="top">I took this into photoshop and jacked up the levels and to me, it made the marble stand out a lot more by adding contrast.  As it is, it seems a little flat.  I think this is partly due to underexposure caused by the light background.</td>', 'I took this into photoshop and jacked up the levels and to me, it made the marble stand out a lot more by adding contrast.  As it is, it seems a little flat.  I think this is partly due to underexposure caused by the light background.', '2003-07-22 23:33:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(363958, 29196, 1031, '<td valign="top">Lighting looks a bit harsh for this subject.</td>', 'Lighting looks a bit harsh for this subject.', '2003-07-22 23:35:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(363959, 28200, 2152, '<td valign="top">I like the lighting and composition, but I think a more perfect circle and a greater dof would help this shot a bit.</td>', 'I like the lighting and composition, but I think a more perfect circle and a greater dof would help this shot a bit.', '2003-07-22 23:36:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(363960, 29147, 1031, '<td valign="top">Upper edge of the ball looks a tad over-sharp for my taste; nice color and detail.</td>', 'Upper edge of the ball looks a tad over-sharp for my taste; nice color and detail.', '2003-07-22 23:36:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(363962, 29039, 2152, '<td valign="top">The lighting, perspective and neg. space make this more interesting than most flower shots.  But I think I''d like to see more light on the flower at the bottom of the frame.</td>', 'The lighting, perspective and neg. space make this more interesting than most flower shots.  But I think I''d like to see more light on the flower at the bottom of the frame.', '2003-07-22 23:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(363963, 29117, 9893, '<td valign="top">Theibald inspired? *suddenly hungry*</td>', 'Theibald inspired? *suddenly hungry*', '2003-07-22 23:40:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(363966, 28441, 2152, '<td valign="top">The color is nice and the photo is sharp.  However, it appears to be slightly unlevel and the subject does not interest me greatly.</td>', 'The color is nice and the photo is sharp.  However, it appears to be slightly unlevel and the subject does not interest me greatly.', '2003-07-22 23:41:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(363967, 29136, 1031, '<td valign="top">Harshness of the light brings out the color but doesn''t help with the texture of these.</td>', 'Harshness of the light brings out the color but doesn''t help with the texture of these.', '2003-07-22 23:43:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(363969, 29091, 9893, '<td valign="top">I like this piece... because it''s making me very curious. It seems sexual!</td>', 'I like this piece... because it''s making me very curious. It seems sexual!', '2003-07-22 23:44:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(363971, 29061, 1031, '<td valign="top">I bet from this low a perspective a lot of people won''t see it at first.</td>', 'I bet from this low a perspective a lot of people won''t see it at first.', '2003-07-22 23:48:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(363972, 28747, 1031, '<td valign="top">Nice "special effects."</td>', 'Nice "special effects."', '2003-07-22 23:51:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(363973, 29032, 1031, '<td valign="top">Well I just noticed that the unopened buds have the same hexagonal cross-section as the honeycomb--very interesting!.</td>', 'Well I just noticed that the unopened buds have the same hexagonal cross-section as the honeycomb--very interesting!.', '2003-07-22 23:55:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(363976, 29153, 2152, '<td valign="top">Until I saw the note I was going to give you a 1 because this was obviously not taken within the challenge period.  Now I''ll give it a 1 because I\''m convinced you edited the EXIF data.  Surely you could have found something round during the challenge?!  just kidding... come on... people need to find something better to do with their time.<br/> <br/>Composition is good.  But I think that because there\''s no overwhelming color, it might be a good candidate for black and white or possibly sepia.  It would really bring out the texture in the road and the walls.</td>', 'Until I saw the note I was going to give you a 1 because this was obviously not taken within the challenge period.  Now I''ll give it a 1 because I\''m convinced you edited the EXIF data.  Surely you could have found something round during the challenge?!  just kidding... come on... people need to find something better to do with their time. Composition is good.  But I think that because there\''s no overwhelming color, it might be a good candidate for black and white or possibly sepia.  It would really bring out the texture in the road and the walls.', '2003-07-23 00:03:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(363977, 29179, 1031, '<td valign="top">I''ve seen hay rolls, but never with covers. Are they raincoats or <i>in situ</i> silage? Great light on the butte in the back.</td>', 'I''ve seen hay rolls, but never with covers. Are they raincoats or in situ silage? Great light on the butte in the back.', '2003-07-23 00:06:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(363979, 28716, 1031, '<td valign="top">Ow</td>', 'Ow', '2003-07-23 00:09:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(363982, 28852, 8981, '<td valign="top">You know, I thought this was a record from the thumbnail.  I really like this one, it''s a very cool perspective.</td>', 'You know, I thought this was a record from the thumbnail.  I really like this one, it''s a very cool perspective.', '2003-07-23 00:15:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(363983, 29082, 8981, '<td valign="top">Gross name, cool pic.  I like it!</td>', 'Gross name, cool pic.  I like it!', '2003-07-23 00:18:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(363984, 28611, 8981, '<td valign="top">I like this.  It''s sleek and smart.  I also would really like to know where O street is.  Good job!</td>', 'I like this.  It''s sleek and smart.  I also would really like to know where O street is.  Good job!', '2003-07-23 00:21:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(363987, 29055, 8981, '<td valign="top">This is a very interesting picture.  I like the idea, but I think it would have been a bit more effective with a completely black background.  Also if there was an angle to take the picture to where you couldn''t see the camera''s reflection.  All in all good job!  7</td>', 'This is a very interesting picture.  I like the idea, but I think it would have been a bit more effective with a completely black background.  Also if there was an angle to take the picture to where you couldn''t see the camera''s reflection.  All in all good job!  7', '2003-07-23 00:25:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(363988, 28110, 8981, '<td valign="top">I like this picture but I feel like the blurred image could have been cropped from the bottom.  Plus there seems to be some noise.  A run through Neat Image could help fix this.</td>', 'I like this picture but I feel like the blurred image could have been cropped from the bottom.  Plus there seems to be some noise.  A run through Neat Image could help fix this.', '2003-07-23 00:27:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(363989, 28879, 4258, '<td valign="top">Love the texture - the grains/noise enhances it</td>', 'Love the texture - the grains/noise enhances it', '2003-07-23 00:29:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(363993, 29028, 8981, '<td valign="top">Looks scruptious!  Nice on color and composition.  Very round!</td>', 'Looks scruptious!  Nice on color and composition.  Very round!', '2003-07-23 00:32:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(363995, 29120, 7711, '<td valign="top">(I won''t tell your secret that cultured pearls aren''t made from a grain of sand..) I like the full frame of this, and the rich lustre of the pearls. well done.</td>', '(I won''t tell your secret that cultured pearls aren''t made from a grain of sand..) I like the full frame of this, and the rich lustre of the pearls. well done.', '2003-07-23 00:34:53.000000', NULL, 1),
