(364116, 28202, 9932, '<td valign="top">I joined DPC on July 7th and I shot this photo on July 9th. <br/> <br/>I knew the quality of this photo was not that good. And I had no plans of submitting any photos to the challenges until I looked at this one.<br/> <br/>I was just tinkering around with some night shots and noticed the meteor in the lower left corner. <br/> <br/>When I saw the Round challenge I thought I would submit it for others to see and not really for the competition.<br/> <br/>I''am pleased with what votes it got though and for those that saw the photo for what is was.<br/> <br/>Thanks;<br/> <br/>Calvus<br/> <br/></td>', 'I joined DPC on July 7th and I shot this photo on July 9th.  I knew the quality of this photo was not that good. And I had no plans of submitting any photos to the challenges until I looked at this one. I was just tinkering around with some night shots and noticed the meteor in the lower left corner.  When I saw the Round challenge I thought I would submit it for others to see and not really for the competition. I''am pleased with what votes it got though and for those that saw the photo for what is was. Thanks; Calvus ', '2003-07-23 01:35:02.000000', NULL, 0),
