(364459, 28455, 5728, '<td valign="top">Thanx for all the comments and votes. This was very easy to do, all I did was turned off all the lights in the room so it was completely dark. I put my finger on the glass of the plasma lamp so that the streams flowed more concentratedly and took some pics at a slower shutter speed.<br/> <br/>@ Annie: We''ll see about that :-) Congrats to you anyway, only 0.007 behind me.<br/> <br/></td>', 'Thanx for all the comments and votes. This was very easy to do, all I did was turned off all the lights in the room so it was completely dark. I put my finger on the glass of the plasma lamp so that the streams flowed more concentratedly and took some pics at a slower shutter speed. @ Annie: We''ll see about that :-) Congrats to you anyway, only 0.007 behind me. ', '2003-07-23 05:52:08.000000', NULL, 0),
