(364501, 29019, 9669, '<td valign="top">This is beautiful!  I have tried long exposures from the roof of my car, through a road tunnel, and from a tram, but these are all so bumpy, and the view is dirty.  It looks so clean!  Its fantastic!  I can''t believe how well the shades of yellow/brown go together.  I''ll mark this as only my second favourite on here.</td>', 'This is beautiful!  I have tried long exposures from the roof of my car, through a road tunnel, and from a tram, but these are all so bumpy, and the view is dirty.  It looks so clean!  Its fantastic!  I can''t believe how well the shades of yellow/brown go together.  I''ll mark this as only my second favourite on here.', '2003-07-23 07:27:45.000000', NULL, 0),
