(364589, 28706, 5964, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the comments everyone! I don''t own any ND filters and I tried to get a slow shutter speed using sunglasses but it wasn''t enough. Even though it was a cloudy day it still didn''t work. One day I will get some ND filters till then no day time action :(<br/> <br/>Thanks again</td>', 'Thanks for the comments everyone! I don''t own any ND filters and I tried to get a slow shutter speed using sunglasses but it wasn''t enough. Even though it was a cloudy day it still didn''t work. One day I will get some ND filters till then no day time action :( Thanks again', '2003-07-23 09:44:32.000000', NULL, 0),
