(366377, 29126, 772, '<td valign="top">Mag,<br/> <br/>This *is* an excellent shot.  The more I look at it, the more titles I think of that would really work strongly with this as well :)  Those clouds in the distance look like a ''storm'' rolling in.  Since they are also illuminated much more than the capital building, it looks like this ''storm'' has much more power than anything else in the photo.  It really seems to create a nice theme for certain current political events and news stories.  The US, being the powerful nation that it is, is constantly under various pressures and threats.  Your ''storm'' seems to accent that for me.  <br/> <br/>In the words of the immortal bluesman, Robert Johnson, "Hell Hounds on My Trail....."<br/> <br/>Kudos...<br/></td>', 'Mag, This *is* an excellent shot.  The more I look at it, the more titles I think of that would really work strongly with this as well :)  Those clouds in the distance look like a ''storm'' rolling in.  Since they are also illuminated much more than the capital building, it looks like this ''storm'' has much more power than anything else in the photo.  It really seems to create a nice theme for certain current political events and news stories.  The US, being the powerful nation that it is, is constantly under various pressures and threats.  Your ''storm'' seems to accent that for me.   In the words of the immortal bluesman, Robert Johnson, "Hell Hounds on My Trail....." Kudos...', '2003-07-24 23:29:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(366532, 28934, 4008, '<td valign="top">O.K. I will try to offers some advice and explain why I did not rate this picture high. First of all the fit to the challenge theme : it does not really express roundness to me, although the flower is round. People already commented on the crop you did which removed some roundness. Second, I am sensitive in my voting for originality and quality. A different angle, an original twitch, something which creates a smile, or just sheer beauty. And that is very difficult with a flower shot because there are so many of them around. Yours is o.k. but the flower is bang in the middle, straight from the top and does not get additional points from me because of that. Try to catch peoples attention, by sheer beauty, by originality, by humor, by raising a question. Base condition is a good fit to the theme. And ensure it is also technically a good photograph by choosing the composition, light, focus etc so it supports the message you want to get across.   hope this helps. Willem</td>', 'O.K. I will try to offers some advice and explain why I did not rate this picture high. First of all the fit to the challenge theme : it does not really express roundness to me, although the flower is round. People already commented on the crop you did which removed some roundness. Second, I am sensitive in my voting for originality and quality. A different angle, an original twitch, something which creates a smile, or just sheer beauty. And that is very difficult with a flower shot because there are so many of them around. Yours is o.k. but the flower is bang in the middle, straight from the top and does not get additional points from me because of that. Try to catch peoples attention, by sheer beauty, by originality, by humor, by raising a question. Base condition is a good fit to the theme. And ensure it is also technically a good photograph by choosing the composition, light, focus etc so it supports the message you want to get across.   hope this helps. Willem', '2003-07-25 06:54:57.000000', NULL, 0),
