(370064, 28546, 9809, '<td valign="top">I could have got closer to the moon with a different lens, but I liked the way it was framed in the trees, and the trees themselves each form a crude quarter circle, plus the hill in the background has a roundish look to it. I realized this wouldn''t win big, but I liked it and felt it did meet the challenge category. Oh well, there''s always next time. This first submission gives me something to beat.</td>', 'I could have got closer to the moon with a different lens, but I liked the way it was framed in the trees, and the trees themselves each form a crude quarter circle, plus the hill in the background has a roundish look to it. I realized this wouldn''t win big, but I liked it and felt it did meet the challenge category. Oh well, there''s always next time. This first submission gives me something to beat.', '2003-07-30 00:20:32.000000', NULL, 0),
