(1690361, 28374, 22517, '<td valign="top">The blank space in the upper left corner catches my eye, it is too big. The lettering on the lid looks out of focus, but probably isn''t? Distracting, though. Coins look good, though.</td>', 'The blank space in the upper left corner catches my eye, it is too big. The lettering on the lid looks out of focus, but probably isn''t? Distracting, though. Coins look good, though.', '2005-09-09 13:25:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(1784036, 29091, 43463, '<td valign="top">The composition and lighting make this piece very interesting. I see something no one else has mentioned. I see something that you really could have played up in this photo (although it may have detracted attention from the main focus of the challenge). The chrome sphere behind the two eggs is getting a reflection off of the eggs which make it look like two eyes. Specifically, the shape of the that sphere and the two eyes make it look like an alien head very similiar to what sci-fi fans call Greys. That imagery coupled with those two eggs makes me think of the sci-fi movie Alien and how they used to advertise it - an egg cracking open with a green glow. All you would have needed to further establish a stronger connection was to have one of those supermarket checkout rags that proclaim in the headline that "Aliens have landed!!!"</td>', 'The composition and lighting make this piece very interesting. I see something no one else has mentioned. I see something that you really could have played up in this photo (although it may have detracted attention from the main focus of the challenge). The chrome sphere behind the two eggs is getting a reflection off of the eggs which make it look like two eyes. Specifically, the shape of the that sphere and the two eyes make it look like an alien head very similiar to what sci-fi fans call Greys. That imagery coupled with those two eggs makes me think of the sci-fi movie Alien and how they used to advertise it - an egg cracking open with a green glow. All you would have needed to further establish a stronger connection was to have one of those supermarket checkout rags that proclaim in the headline that "Aliens have landed!!!"', '2005-10-14 13:39:09.000000', NULL, 0),
